2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Don BLAS MARIA2 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-TREVINO (Don MARCOS-ALONSO1 DE-LA-GARZA-Y-ARCON) was born Abt. 1591 in Real de Mapimi, Durango, Mexico, and died February 21, 1669 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. He married BEATRIZ GONZALEZ
2 CONC -HIDALGO-NAVARRO Bef. 1626 in Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico, daughter of MARCOS GONZALEZ-HIDALGO-DE-VALLE and MARIANA NAVARRO-RODRIGUEZ. She was born Abt. 1591 in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico, and died May 10, 1670 in Monterrey, Nuevo 
2 CONC Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT _____
2 CONT
2 CONT Image as profile indicates deceased Beatriz Gonzalea navaroo as the widow of Blas de la Garza Falcon Trevino.
2 CONT
