1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Diego MONTEMAYOR RODRIGUEZ m. 1664/65, Maria Ines DE-LA-GARZA GONZALEZ HIDALGO, b. abt 1642, (daughter of Blas DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON TREVIÑO and Beatriz GONZALEZ-HIDALGO NAVARRO) d. 12 Mar 1690.  Diego died 3 May 1676
2 CONC .
2 CONT * 			a.	Maria RODRIGUEZ MONTEMAYOR m. 21 Jun 1689, in Monterrey, N.L., Mex, Antonio LOPEZ PRIETO, (son of Nicolas LOPEZ PRIETO and Maria AYALA OVALLE). 
2 CONT * 			b.	Juan RODRIGUEZ MONTEMAYOR DE-LA-GARZA m. 21 Oct 1691, in Monterrey, N.L., Mex, Antonia GALVAN BOTELLO, (daughter of Diego GALVAN and Petronila BOTELLO DE-LA-GARZA). 
2 CONT * 			c.	Francisco RODRIGUEZ MONTEMAYOR DE-LA-GA m. 23 Nov 1684, in Monterrey, N.L., Mex, Maria CABALLERO BARRAZA. 
2 CONT  		  http://www.vsalgs.org/stnemgenealogy/diegom.html
2 CONT =========================
2 CONT MARIA-INES3 DE-LA-GARZA-GONZALEZ-HIDALGO (BLAS MARIA2 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-TREVINO, MARCOS-ALONSO1 DE-LA-GARZA-Y-ARCON) was born Abt. 1623 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and died March 12, 1690 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. S
2 CONC he married DIEGO RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR 1664 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, son of MIGUEL DEL CANTO-MONTEMAYOR and MONICA RODRIGUEZ-TREVINO. He was born Abt. 1623 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and died May 03, 1676 in Mont
2 CONC errey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for DIEGO RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR:
2 CONT
2 CONT Mil Familias III by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza. Page 67.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of MARIA-INES DE-LA-GARZA-GONZALEZ-HIDALGO and DIEGO RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR are:
2 CONT
2 CONT 46. i. JOSEPH4 RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR.
