2 CONT Capt. Alonso de TREVIÑO (The Younger) 
2 CONT *was born about 1629. 
2 CONT *He was chief mayor of Valle de las Salinas at the end of the 17th century. 
2 CONT *Parents: Capt. Alonso de TREVIÑO de la Garza and Anastacia GONZALEZ Hidalgo.
2 CONT *Spouse: Catalina (or Catarina) de AYALA. Catalina (or Catarina) de AYALA and Capt. Alonso de TREVIÑO (The Younger) were married before 1666. Children were: 
2 CONT **1. Maria de TREVIÑO, 
2 CONT **2. Anastacia de TREVIÑO, 
2 CONT **3. Francisco de TREVIÑO, 
2 CONT **4. Antonio TREVIÑO, 
2 CONT **5. Capt. Alonso de TREVIÑO, 
2 CONT **6. Joseph de TREVIÑO.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==============================================
2 CONT
2 CONT 8.  Alonso de la Garza Trevino FALCON (Marcos Alonzo Garza Y del Arcon) 
2 CONT *was born 1600. 
2 CONT *He  died 1660. 
2 CONT *Alonso married Anastacia Gonzalez HIDALGO. They had the following children:
2 CONT **1. 34 M i. Melchor de TREVINO. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ====================
2 CONT
2 CONT *Gen11  Alonso de Trevino  b: Abt. 1629  + Catalina de Ayala  (Father: Jose de Ayala  Mother: Ana Baez-Benavides)
2 CONT **Gen12  
2 CONT ***1. Anastacia de Trevino  (b: Abt. 1675  d: 3/27/1707) + Diego G. de Ochoa  (m: 4/14/1690  d: 10/20/1728  Father: Diego de Quintanilla  Mother: Maria de Ochoa)
2 CONT ***2.  Clara de Trevino  (b: 1683) +Jose de la Mota  (m: 8/22/1701  Father: Juan de la Mota  Mother: Maria Flores)
