1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.currays.net/Gonzalez%20Web%20Project/ps03/ps03_461.htm ... Martha Duron Jimenez and Ignacio Narro Etchegaray. ''DICCIONARIO BIOGRAFICO DE SALTILLO'', Mayo 1995, p. 128:  '''Juan NAVARRO''', a founder of 
2 CONC Saltillo, native of Navarra, was known by the nickname El Vizcaino [a reference to his Basque origins].  He '''married Dona Maria RODRIGUEZ''', daughter of Capitan Baltasar de SOSA and Dona Ines RODRIGUEZ.  Their '''children were'
2 CONC '':  Beatriz, whose first marriage was to Capitan Alonso ALBORNOZ and second marriage was to Capitan Bernabe de las CASAS; '''Ursula, who married Capitan Diego SANCHEZ'''; Melchora, who married Capitan Martin SANCHEZ; Ines, who ma
2 CONC rried Capitan Francisco MARTINEZ GUAJARDO; Maria, who married Capitan Jose de TREVINO; Francisca, who married Capitan Juan TARANCO VALLEJO; Martin, who married Maria ROJO de las RUELAS; and Mariana NAVARRO RODRIGUEZ, who married C
2 CONC apitan Marcos GONZALEZ HIDALGO.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''__________________________'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Ines (Ursula) Rodriguez NAVARRO (aka Ursula Catarina Navarro)432 was born (date unknown). IMIG #37-4 gives her name as Francisca Navarro but I believe that to be in error. Parents: Juan NAVARRO and Maria RODRIGUEZ.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Francisco MARTINEZ GUAJARDO. Ines (Ursula) Rodriguez NAVARRO (aka Ursula Catarina Navarro) and Francisco MARTINEZ GUAJARDO96,432 were married. Children were: Alferez Real Juan MARTINEZ GUAJARDO, Francisca MARTINEZ, Catalin
2 CONC a MARTINEZ Guajardo, Lorenzo MARTINEZ Guajardo, Isabel MARTINEZ Guajardo, Ines MARTINEZ Guajardo (aka Ines Rodriguez).
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.raullongoria.net/Genealogy/FamilyTree/b165.html#P1013
2 CONT
