1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Estefana de Montemayor y Porcayo de la Cerda''' born about 1571 at Mazapil, Naucalpan, Mexico City, New Spain, died 1611.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married: Alberto Del-Canto (son of Sebastiano Martins Do-Canto and Maria Diaz Vieira) abt 1585, at Saltillo, Coahulia, New Spain. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Estefana and Alberto Del-Canto had the following children:
2 CONT #Elvira Del-Canto Montemayor born about 1586, married Jusepe Tenorio
2 CONT #Miguel Montemayor Del-Canto born about 1588 married Monica Rodriquez Trevino, died Jun 1644
2 CONT #Diego Montemayor Del-Canto born 1589
2 CONT #Maria Del-Canto Montemayor 
2 CONT
2 CONT Estefana was the daughter of don Diego de Montemayor, governor of Nuevo León and Juana Porcallo y de la Cerda.
2 CONT
2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT
2 CONT Estefana's father, Diego de Montemayor murdered her mother, Juana Porcallo y de la Cerda, after discovering that she had been having carnal relations with Alberto del Canto. This was the same Alberto del Canto who Estefania later 
2 CONC married.
2 CONT
