2 CONC eva Galicia, New Spain.111 Her godparents were General Juan Bautista de Lomas y Colmenares and his wife Francisca Ponce de Leon. Marriage investigation #12-1, page 62, names her as Maria de Abrego, sister of Isabel Gutierrez. Marr
