1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 75. PEDRO4 FLORES-DE-VALDEZ (DIEGO3 FLORES-DE-VALDEZ-SALAZAR, MARIA-ISABEL2 DE SALAZAR-Y-TREVINO, PEDRO1 DE SALAZAR) 
2 CONT *was born in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico. 
2 CONT *He married (1) MARIA SANCHEZ-NAVARRO 23 Jul 1683 in Guadalajara, Guadalajara, Mexico, 
2 CONT **daughter of BERNARDINO SANCHEZ-NAVARRO and MARIA DE-LA-FUENTE-MARTINEZ. She was born 1665, and 
2 CONT **died Bef. 1692. 
2 CONT *He married (2) MARIANA MONTALVO-DE-LA-BARRERA 30 Dec 1692 in Santiago Apostol, Monclova, Coahuila, Mexico, 
2 CONT **daughter of JOSEPH DE MONTALVO and BEATRIZ DE-LA-BARRERA-NAVARRO. She was born 1674 in Monclova, Coahulia, Mexico.
2 CONT ***Notes for PEDRO FLORES-DE-VALDEZ: Source:Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara, by Raul J. Guerra., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 185
2 CONT ***Marriage Notes for PEDRO FLORES-DE-VALDEZ and MARIANA MONTALVO-DE-LA-BARRERA: Marriage source:Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Pag
2 CONC e 185.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of PEDRO FLORES-DE-VALDEZ and MARIA SANCHEZ-NAVARRO is:
2 CONT *1. i. BLAS5 VALDEZ-SANCHEZ, 
2 CONT **m. MARIA-DE-GUADALUPE FLORES-DE-ABREGO, 12 Jul 1717, Santiago Apostol, Monclova, Coahuila, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. 1700, Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico.
2 CONT
