2 CONT 6. SERGEANT MAJOR JUAN3 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-GONZALEZ-HIDALGO (BLAS MARIA2 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-TREVINO, MARCOS-ALONSO1 DE-LA-GARZA-Y-ARCON) was born Abt. 1620 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and died May 03, 1673 in Monterrey, Nuev
2 CONC o Leon, Mexico. He married MARIA-MARGARITA RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR Abt. 1640 in Mexico City, F.D. Mexico, daughter of MIGUEL DEL CANTO-MONTEMAYOR and MONICA RODRIGUEZ-TREVINO. She was born Abt. 1626 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexic
2 CONC o, and died February 27, 1680/81 in Hacienda San Juan Bautista, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
