2 CONT 6. MARIA4 RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR (MIGUEL3 DEL CANTO-MONTEMAYOR, ALBERTO2 DEL CANTO, SEBASTIANO MARTINS1) was born 1628 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. She married CAPTAIN ANTONIO DE MORALES-TREVINO 10 Jun 1654 in Monterrey, Nue
2 CONC vo Leon, Mexico, son of LUIS RAMON-DE-MORALES and JUANA DE TREVINO-QUINTANILLA-Y-SALAZAR. He was born in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
