2 CONC ía De Sosa Y Guerra Cañamar (born De La Garza Falcón Y López Prieto), Margarita Rodriguez (born De La Garza López Prieto), Blas De La Garza López Prieto, Juan Christobal De La Garza López, Maria Raimunda Sanchez De La Barrera Trev
