1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 3. PEDRO3 FLORES-DE-ABREGO (PEDRO2, PEDRO1) was born in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico, and died March 16, 1682 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. He married JOSEFA DE CEPEDA-CABALLERO in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico, dau
2 CONC ghter of ESTEBAN DE CEPEDA-DE-LA-FUENTE and ISABEL CAMACHO-Y-OLEA-BAEZA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for PEDRO FLORES-DE-ABREGO:
2 CONT
2 CONT On April 1, 1682, he signed his last will and testament.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: Testamentos Coloniales de Monterrey, by Lilia E. Villanueva de Cavazos.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of PEDRO FLORES-DE-ABREGO and JOSEFA DE CEPEDA-CABALLERO are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. FRANCISCO JAVIER4 FLORES-DE-ABREGO-Y-CEPEDA.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. BALTAZAR FLORES-DE-ABREGO-Y-CEPEDA.
2 CONT
2 CONT 11. iii. LAZARO FLORES-DE-ABREGO-Y-CEPEDA.
2 CONT
2 CONT 12. iv. MARIA FLORES-DE-ABREGO, b. 1676, Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT v. ANTONIA FLORES-DE-ABREGO-Y-CEPEDA, b. 1687; m. LUIS FARIAS-AGUIRRE, April 20, 1705, Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico; b. 1685.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for LUIS FARIAS-AGUIRRE: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara, by Raul J. Guerra., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 282
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.somosprimos.com/inclan/floresabrego.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT 1. CAPTAIN PEDRO2 FLORES-DE-ABREGO (PEDRO1) was born Abt. 1615 in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico, and died December 22, 1678 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. He married (2) Dona MARGARITA DE-LA-GARZA-GONZALEZ-HIDALGO 1650, daughter o
2 CONC f Don BLAS DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-TREVINO and Dona BEATRIZ GONZALEZ-HIDALGO-NAVARRO. She was born Abt. 1637 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and died Abt. 1693 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for PEDRO FLORES-DE-ABREGO and MARGARITA DE-LA-GARZA-GONZALEZ-HIDALGO:
2 CONT
2 CONT With All Arms, A Study of a Kindred Group, by Carl Laurence Duaine.
2 CONT
2 CONT Origin of the Surnames Garza and Trevino in Nuevo Leon, by Tomas Mendirichaga Cueva. Page 29.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of CAPTAIN PEDRO FLORES-DE-ABREGO is:
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. i. MARIA3 DE LESA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of PEDRO FLORES-DE-ABREGO and MARGARITA DE-LA-GARZA-GONZALEZ-HIDALGO are:
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. ii. PEDRO3 FLORES-DE-ABREGO, b. Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico; d. March 16, 1682, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. iii. MARIA FLORES-DE-ABREGO.
2 CONT
2 CONT iv. JOSEPH FLORES-DE-ABREGO.
2 CONT
2 CONT v. TOMAS FLORES-DE-ABREGO.
2 CONT
2 CONT vi. LEONOR FLORES-DE-ABREGO.
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. vii. MARIA-TOMASINA FLORES-DE-ABREGO, b. 1657; d. April 13, 1680, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; Stepchild.
2 CONT
2 CONT 6. viii. GERTRUDIS DE-LA-GARZA, b. 1657, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; d. August 18, 1688, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 7. ix. ALFEREZ MARCOS FLORES-DE-ABREGO-DE-LA-GARZA, b. 1663, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 8. x. NICOLASA FLORES-DE-ABREGO, b. 1663; d. August 17, 1683.
2 CONT
