2 CONT 6. GERTRUDIS3 DE-LA-GARZA (PEDRO2 FLORES-DE-ABREGO, PEDRO1) was born 1657 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and died August 18, 1688 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. She married CAPTAIN DIEGO GUTIERREZ-DE-CASTRO July 30, 1673 in 
2 CONC Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, son of DIEGO GUTIERREZ-DE-CASTRO and JUANA-FRANCISCA AYALA-DE-OVALLE. He was born 1650 in Zacatecas, Mexico.
2 CONT
