1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Nicolasa DE LA GARZA FALCON (aka Nicolasa de Renteria)1271 died on 10 August 1703.1271 Parents: Sgt. Major Francisco DE LA GARZA FALCON and Leonor GARCIA DE SEPULVEDA (aka Leonor de Renteria).
