2 CONT Spouse: Antonio FERNANDEZ VALLEJO (aka Antonio Vallejo). Nicolasa DE LA GARZA FALCON (aka Nicolasa de Renteria) and Antonio FERNANDEZ VALLEJO (aka Antonio Vallejo) were married on 25 May 1685.1271
