1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Alberto do Canto was from Portugal.In Portugal the rule of the double last name is the opposite of Spain's, in Spain the paternal is first followed by the maternal. In Portugal it is the maternal first followed by 
2 CONC the paterna l.
2 CONT Alberto's formal last name is Alberto Vieira do Canto 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Hlen, Hleneto.  ''Medieval Canto family'', NFP/MJCF Blog, "Considerations on the origin of the family Canto, in ''Nobilário de Famílias de Portugal'' of Manoel Jose da Costa Feigueiras Gayo"  [sexta-feira, 1 de julho de 2011]  ...
2 CONC   '''John, 3rd Earl of Kent''' versus '''Sir John Chandos''' as Canto family founder  ...  http://familiacantomedievalnfpmjcfg-en.blogspot.com/  ...  However, John Chandos married Philippa de Bryan and died without issue [ http://
2 CONC www.themcs.org/characters/John%20Chandos.htm ] while John, 3rd Earl of Kent, married Isabella of Jülich and also '''died without issue on 26 December 1352''' at age 22. [ http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John,_3rd_Earl_of_Kent ].  So.
2 CONC ....who is the Canto family founder?
2 CONT
