2 CONT 3168. Alberto CANTO was born in 1547 in Isle Terceira,Azores,Portugal. He died on Dec 10 1611 in Saltillo,Coahuila,Mexico. He married Estefana MONTEMAYOR in 1585 in Saltillo,Coahuila,Mexico. 
