2 _MARNM Méndez Tovar
1 SEX F
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Josepha MENDEZ Tovar [2545] was born (date unknown). Could Josepha Mendez Tovar be the same person as Luzgarda de Medina?
2 CONT
2 CONT The marriage investigation for Nicolas Ochoa de Elejalde and Margarita Garcia de Avila (#49-14, page 216, conducted on October 25, 1711) notes that Nicolas Ochoa de Elejalde was a widower of Margarita de las Casas (aka Maria Rita 
2 CONC de las Casas) and further notes that Margarita was his second wife. However, the marriage investigation for Nicolas Ochoa de Elejalde and Maria Rita de las Casas (#39-16, page 170, conducted on January 15, 1697) notes that Nicolas
2 CONC  was a widower of Luzgarda de Medina, implying that Maria Rita de las Casas was Nicolas' third wife. A possible explanation is that Luzgarda de Medina and Josepha Mendez Tovar were the same person. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents: Capt. Joseph MENDEZ Tovar and Leonor GONZALEZ (aka Leonor Gutierrez Hidalgo).
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Alferez Nicolas OCHOA de Elejalde (del Ejalde). Josepha MENDEZ Tovar and Alferez Nicolas OCHOA de Elejalde (del Ejalde) were married after 16 August 1689.[2545]
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.raullongoria.net/Genealogy/FamilyTree/b159.html#P8408
