1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mendirichaga Cueva, Tomás.  ''Apellidos de Nuevo León'' ... ''Siglos XVI, XVII y XVIII'', Grupo Financiero Banorte, Mexico, 1993, page 351.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''__________________________________________________'''
2 CONT
2 CONT From the work of Miguel A. Ayala (webcached 12/29/2012):
2 CONT
2 CONT http://webcache.googleusercontent.com/search?q=cache:http://familytreemaker.genealogy.com/users/a/y/a/Miguel-A-Ayala-TX/WEBSITE-0001/UHP-0315.html
2 CONT
2 CONT On April 6, 1695, Mariana de Sosa, widow of Diego Garcia de Quintanilla, sold the part of the Hacienda de Catalina that her husband had inherited from his parents, Captain Lucas Garcia and Juliana de Quintanilla. She sold her shar
2 CONC e of the Hacienda because each of her six children would inherit only a small piece of the hacienda, pieces too small to use effectively. The sale price was 210 pesos; it was bought by Blas de Arrechederra y Gallarreta, a merchant
2 CONC  and mayor of Monterrey, and his wife Maria Gonzales Hidalgo. 
2 CONT
2 CONT In the transaction noted above, Mariana de Sosa states that Pedro de Longoria and Agustina are the parents of Diego, Jose and Maria. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents: Capt. Vicente de ZALDIVAR and Maria de SOSA .
2 CONT
2 CONT She was married to Diego GARCIA de Quintanilla . Children were: 
2 CONT *1. Augustina GARCIA, 
2 CONT *2. Gaspar GARCIA, 
2 CONT *3. Josefa GARCIA de Quintanilla , 
2 CONT *4. Vicente de ZALDIVAR, 
2 CONT *5. Maria de SOSA.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.raullongoria.net/Genealogy/FamilyTree/d141.html#P975
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT [5]	Mariana SOSA SALDIVAR m. Diego GARCIA DE-QUINTANILLA, (son of Lucas GARCIA RODRIGUEZ and Juliana QUINTANILLA FARIAS).
2 CONT
2 CONT  http://www.vsalgs.org/stnemgenealogy/alonsoes.html
2 CONT
