1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mendirichaga Cueva, Tomás.  ''Apellidos de Nuevo León'' ... ''Siglos XVI, XVII y XVIII'', Grupo Financiero Banorte, Mexico, 1993, page 352.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''_________________________________________'''
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Capitan Bartolome Gonzalez Olivares
2 CONT
2 CONT a) Arrived in Monterrey around 1645 as a miner in Valle de Los Salinas and was mayor of Monterrey in 1648.
2 CONT
2 CONT b) Born in 1598, Moron de la Frontera, Sevilla, Spain, died in 1672.
2 CONT
2 CONT c) First wife (1) was Catalina Gonzalez.
2 CONT
2 CONT d) He married (2) Isabel Gomez Esquivel on January 16, 1639.
2 CONT
2 CONT e) Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT i) Andres Gonzalez de Esquivel, born 1642.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii) Diego Gonzalez de Esquivel, born 1645.
2 CONT
2 CONT f) In 1652, he married (3) Ana Garcia de Quintanilla (b. 1625 and d. 1684), daughter of Lucas Garcia Rodriguez and Juliana Quintanilla Farias.
2 CONT
2 CONT g) Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT i) Captain Bartolome Quintanilla II, born 1654.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii) Alferez Nicolas Quintanilla, born 1656
2 CONT
2 CONT iii) Sargento Mayor Joseph Quintanilla, born 1658
2 CONT
2 CONT http://genforum.genealogy.com/vela/messages/105.html
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT He was born in Spain.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Rodolfo de la Garza Gonzalez, Mil Familias de Tam., - N. Leon Coah., y Texas III, p. 260.
