2 CONT ''"1. Don JUAN-FRANCISCO1 MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO was born Abt. 1565, and died 1607. He married Dona URSULA-INES-CATARINA NAVARRO-RODRIGUEZ Abt. 1600, daughter of Don JUAN NAVARRO and Dona MARIA RODRIGUEZ-DE-SOSA. She was born 1581.
2 CONT
2 CONT ''Notes for JUAN-FRANCISCO MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO:
2 CONT
2 CONT Source:With All Arms by Carl Laurence Duaine. Page 241.
2 CONT
2 CONT Origen de los Fundadores de Texas, Muevo Mexico, Coahuila y Nuevo Leon, Saltillo Tomo II by
2 CONT
2 CONT Guillermo Garmendia Leal. Page 56.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of JUAN-FRANCISCO MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO and URSULA-INES-CATARINA NAVARRO-RODRIGUEZ are:
2 CONT
2 CONT 8. vii. LORENZO MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO-NAVARRO, b. 1610; d. Bef. 1664, Saltillo,'' Coahulia, Mexico."'
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 8. LORENZO MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO-NAVARRO (JUAN-FRANCISCO1 MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO) was born 1610, and died Bef. 1664 in Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico. He married YLDEFONSA FLORES-DE-VALDEZ-SALAZAR 1630, daughter of RODRIGO FLORES-DE-VALDEZ-CAR
2 CONC BALLO and MARIA-ISABEL DE SALAZAR-Y-TREVINO. She was born 1612.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of LORENZO MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO-NAVARRO and YLDEFONSA FLORES-DE-VALDEZ-SALAZAR are:
2 CONT
2 CONT 40. i. MATIANA3 MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO, b. Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. RODRIGO GUAJARDO, m. TEODORA DE CEPEDA, Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for RODRIGO GUAJARDO:
2 CONT
2 CONT Source:Origen de los Fundadores de Texas, Nuevo Mexico, Coahulia y Nuevo Leon, Saltillo,
2 CONT
2 CONT Tomo II by Guillermo Garmendia Leal. Page 104.
2 CONT
2 CONT 41. iii. LEONARDA DE GUAJARDO.
2 CONT
2 CONT 42. iv. THEODORA FLORES-DE-ABREGO, b. Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico.
2 CONT
