2 CONT Notes for MARIA-ANA DE SOSA-ALBORNOZ-NAVARRO: In the book, Mil Familias III, by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza, she is listed as a descendent of the Don Alonso of Estrada, Duke of Aragon. Page 85. In 1598, she was with her father in
