2 CONC ARRO and ALONSO DE FARIAS-TREVINO are: i. ANA10 FARIAS-SOSA, m. ALFONSO HERNANDO ARREDONDO-AGUERO-FERNANDEZ, Abt. 1625; b. 1600, Montanas de Burgos, Castilla, Spain. Notes for ANA FARIAS-SOSA: In the book, Mil Familias III, by Rod
