2 CONT Spouse: Melchora (Ursula Catarina) NAVARRO. Melchora (Ursula Catarina) NAVARRO and Martin SANCHEZ432 were married. Children were: Diego SANCHEZ Navarro, Bernardino SANCHEZ Navarro, Mariana SANCHEZ Navarro.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Antonia Perez RODRIGUEZ. Antonia Perez RODRIGUEZ and Martin SANCHEZ were married. Their child was a natural child, indicating that they were unmarried, at least not by the Catholic Church. Children were: Diego Luis SANCHEZ
2 CONC .
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: ______ ______ (mother of Beatriz Sanchez). Children were: Beatriz SANCHEZ, Andres SANCHEZ.
