1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 15. FRANCISCA3 FLORES-DE-VALDEZ-SALAZAR (MARIA-ISABEL2 DE SALAZAR-Y-TREVINO, PEDRO1 DE SALAZAR) was born in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico. She married CAPTAIN JUAN DE CALIS-COY in Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico, son of BE
2 CONC RNARDO DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY and BEATRIZ ROJO-DE-LAS-RUELAS. He was born 1610 in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico, and died 22 Jul 1699 in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for CAPTAIN JUAN DE CALIS-COY: He signed his las will and testament on July 22, 1699. Source:Origen de los Fundadores de Texas, Nuevo Mexico, Coahulia, y Nuevo Leon, by Guillermo Garmendia Leal. (page 77).
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for FRANCISCA FLORES-DE-VALDEZ-SALAZAR and JUAN DE CALIS-COY: Marriage source:Origen de los Fundadores de Texas, Nuevo Mexico, Coahulia, y Nuevo Leon, by Guillermo Garmendia Leal. (page 77).
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of FRANCISCA FLORES-DE-VALDEZ-SALAZAR and JUAN DE CALIS-COY are:
2 CONT * 76. i. MARGARITA4 DE CALIZ, b. Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT * ii. BEATRIZ DE CALIZ-COY, m. DIEGO GARCIA.
2 CONT * 77. iii. LUISA DE CALIZ-FLORES, b. Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT * 78. iv. MARIA-DE-LOS-SANTOS DE VALLE, b. 1657.
2 CONT
