1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mariana GONZALEZ69,107,150,173 died before 13 May 1683.107 Marriage investigation #56-12 notes that she is a sister of Miguel Gonzalez, who I have identified from other investigations as the son of Juan Gonzalez an
