2 CONC  page 67, #239 [III, fol. 104, no. 62].  ...  This protocolo is the will of '''Elena de la Garza,''' '''wife of Captain Juan Cavazos''' and '''daughter of Captain Pedro de la Garza (deceased) and Inés Rodriguez'''.  She cites the 
2 CONC names of her children and sons-in-law Pedro García de Ávila and Agustin de la Vera.  Dated 23 February 1667, Monterrey.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''_____________________'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Cavazos Garza, Israel. '''''Catálogo y Síntesis de los Protocolos del Archivo Municipal de Monterrey 1599-1700''''', Instituto Tecnologico y de Estudios Superiores de Monterrey, Monterrey, Nuevo León, México, 1966, page 67, #240 [
2 CONC III, fol. 109, no. 63].  ...  This protocolo delineates the wedding dowry received by '''Captain Juan Cavazos''' upon his marriage to '''Elena de la Garza''' and names '''her parents Captain Pedro de la Garza and Inés Rodriguez'''
2 CONC .  Dated 22 May 1663, Monterrey.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''_____________________'''
2 CONT
2 CONT This is  on the descendants of The Descendents of Captain Pedro de la Garza Falcon y Trevino   
2 CONT
2 CONT 3 . ELENA3 DE-LA-GARZA-RODRIGUEZ (PEDRO2 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-TREVINO, MARCOS-ALONSO1 DE-LA-GARZA-Y-ARCON) 
2 CONT *was born 1607, and 
2 CONT *died Bet. 1636 - 1705 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT *She married CAPTAIN JUAN CAVAZOS-DEL-CAMPO 1627 in Santa Maria, La Vieja, Castilla, Spain, son of GABRIEL CAVAZOS and SIMONA DEL-CAMPO. 
2 CONT **He was born Abt. 1605 in Santa Maria la Vieja de Castilla, Spain, and
2 CONT **died 15 Jun 1683 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for CAPTAIN JUAN CAVAZOS-DEL-CAMPO: He signed his last will and testament on January 5, 1681.Source:Testamentos Coloniales de Monterrey, by Lilia E. Villanueva de Cavazos. Signed his name Juan Cavazzo.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of ELENA DE-LA-GARZA-RODRIGUEZ and JUAN CAVAZOS-DEL-CAMPO are:
2 CONT *1. i. FRAY JUAN4 CAVAZOS-DE-LA-GARZA, b. 1631, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *2. 12. ii. MARGARITA CAVAZOS-DE-LA-GARZA, b. 1633.
2 CONT *3. 13. iii. CAPTAIN ANTONIO CAVAZOS-DE-LA-GARZA, b. 1635; d. Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *4. iv. CLARA DE-LA-GARZA, b. 1637; d. 24 Jun 1689, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. ALFEREZ AGUSTIN DE-LA-VERA; b. Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT **Marriage Notes for CLARA DE-LA-GARZA and AGUSTIN DE-LA-VERA: From the last will and testament of Captain Juan Cavazos. January 5, 1681.Source:Testamentos Coloniales de Monterrey, by Lilia E. Villanueva de Cavazos.
2 CONT *5. 14. v. MARIA DE-LA-GARZA, b. 1640, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; d. 17 Dec 1675, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *6. 15. vi. LUCIA DE-LA-GARZA, b. 1642; d. Parras de la Fuente, Coahulia, Mexico.
2 CONT *7. 16. vii. JOSEPH CAVAZOS-DE-LA-GARZA, b. 1644.
2 CONT *8. viii. GABRIEL CAVAZOS-DE-LA-GARZA, b. 1646; d. 1680.
2 CONT *9. ix. PABLO CAVAZOS-DE-LA-GARZA, b. 1648; d. 1680.
2 CONT *10. 17. x. JUANA DE-LA-GARZA, b. 1674.
2 CONT
