2 CONT 5. CAPTAIN JOSEPH3 DE-LA-GARZA-RODRIGUEZ (PEDRO2 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-TREVINO, MARCOS-ALONSO1 DE-LA-GARZA-Y-ARCON) 
2 CONT *was born 1616, and 
2 CONT *died 1671 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT *He married (1) MARIA DE SOLIS, 
2 CONT **daughter of DIEGO DE SOLIS and MARIA DE MENDOZA. 
2 CONT *He married (2) JOSEFA DE LEON-GONZALEZ Abt. 1660 in Cadereyta, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, 
2 CONT **daughter of ALONSO PEREZ-DE-LEON and JOSEFA GONZALEZ-HIDALGO-LEAL. She was born 1642 in Cadereyta Jimenez, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and 
2 CONT **died 22 Feb 1725/26 in Cadereyta Jimenez, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT ***Notes for CAPTAIN JOSEPH DE-LA-GARZA-RODRIGUEZ: Source:Origin of the Surnames Garza and Trevino by Tomas Mendirichaga Cueva. Page 19.
2 CONT ***Notes for JOSEFA DE LEON-GONZALEZ: A.K.A. Josefa Gonzalez.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of JOSEPH DE-LA-GARZA-RODRIGUEZ and MARIA DE SOLIS is:
2 CONT *1. 29. i. JOSEFA4 DE-LA-GARZA-SOLIS, 
2 CONT **b. 1652.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of JOSEPH DE-LA-GARZA-RODRIGUEZ and JOSEFA DE LEON-GONZALEZ are:
2 CONT *1. ii. MIGUEL4 DE-LA-GARZA-GONZALEZ, 
2 CONT **b. Cadereita Jimenez, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. LEONOR DE RIVERA, 03 Nov 1683, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. Cadereita Jimenez, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *2. iii. JOSEPH DE-LA-GARZA-GONZALEZ, 
