2 CONT 66. ALEJO9 DE TREVINO-ARRIOLA (FRANCISCO-ALEJO8 DE TREVINO-AYALA, LEONOR7 DE AYALA-VALVERDE, MARIANA6 DE GUEVARA-ESTRADA, JUAN-ALONSO5 DE ESTRADA, ANA4 ESTRADA-DE-LA-CABALLERIA, ALONSO3 DE ESTRADA, FERDINAND II (THE2 CATHOLIC), JO
2 CONC HN II OF1 ARAGON) 
2 CONT *was born 1660 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT *He married (1) JOSEFA CABALLERO-RODRIGUEZ 19 Jun 1689 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, 
2 CONT **daughter of LUCAS CABALLERO-DE-LOS-OLIVOS and MARGARITA RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR. She was born 1671. 
2 CONT *He married (2) JOSEFA CABALLERO-RODRIGUEZ 19 Jun 1689 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of ALEJO DE TREVINO-ARRIOLA and JOSEFA CABALLERO-RODRIGUEZ are:
2 CONT *1. i. MARGARITA10 DE TREVINO-CABALLERO, 
2 CONT **b. Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. (1) CAPTAIN DIEGO DE IGLESIAS-Y-SANTA-CRUZ; 
2 CONT **m. (2) ANDRES FERNANDEZ-DE-TIJERINA, 11 May 1729, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT ****Marriage Notes for MARGARITA DE TREVINO-CABALLERO and ANDRES FERNANDEZ-DE-TIJERINA: Marriage source:Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerrera, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela
2 CONC , Jr. Page 254.
2 CONT *2. ii. CATHARINA DE TREVINO, 
2 CONT **m. FRANCISCO FERNANDEZ-DE-TIJERINA, 05 Oct 1712, Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *3. iii. JOSEPH DE TREVINO-CABALLERO, 
2 CONT **m. MARIA TERESA DE TIJERINA.
2 CONT *4. iv. TERESA TREVINO-CABALLERO, 
2 CONT **m. (2) PEDRO JOSEPH GARCIA-GUERRA; 
2 CONT ***b. Abt. 1655; 
2 CONT ***d. 07 May 1701, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *5. v. FRANCISCO-JAVIER DE TREVINO-CABALLERO.
2 CONT *6. vi. PEDRO-REGALDO DE TREVINO, 
2 CONT **b. 1718; 
2 CONT **m. MARIA-GERTRUDIS AYALA-TREVINO, 07 Jan 1738/39, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. 06 Nov 1718, Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
