2 CONT http://www.raullongoria.net/Genealogy/FamilyTree/b188.html#P9147
2 CONT =======================
2 CONT 57. MARIA-CATARINA6 RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR (FRANCISCO5, DIEGO4, MIGUEL3 DEL CANTO-MONTEMAYOR, ALBERTO2 DEL CANTO, SEBASTIANO MARTINS1) was born 1690 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and died in Guajuco, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. She m
2 CONC arried CAPTAIN JUAN-ANTONIO DE TAMEZ-FLORES 03 Feb 1709 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, son of JUAN TAMEZ-DE-SANCHEZ-DE-HUERTA and NICOLASA FLORES-DE-ABREGO. He was born 11 Jul 1683 in Sagrario Metropolit
2 CONC ano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and died Bef. 1774 in Guajuco, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for CAPTAIN JUAN-ANTONIO DE TAMEZ-FLORES: Familias de Monterrey, Tomo 4, by Guillermo Garmendia Leal. Page 140.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of MARIA-CATARINA RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR and JUAN-ANTONIO DE TAMEZ-FLORES are:
2 CONT
2 CONT 188. i. JUAN-ANGEL7 TAMEZ-RODRIGUEZ, b. Guajuco, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. LUGARDA TAMEZ-RODRIGUEZ.
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. MARIA DE JESUS TAMEZ-RODRIGUEZ.
2 CONT
