1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Joseph RODRIGUEZ de Montemayor [2822] was born [unknown]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents: Capt. Joseph RODRIGUEZ de Montemayor and Antonia GUAJARDO.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Maria Zaragosa RUIZ de OCON. Maria Zaragosa RUIZ de OCON and Joseph RODRIGUEZ de Montemayor were married.[2822] Children were: 
2 CONT *1. Francisco Xavier RODRIGUEZ de Montemayor, 
2 CONT *2. Juan Joseph RODRIGUEZ de Montemayor, 
2 CONT *3. Maria Rita RODRIGUEZ, 
2 CONT *4. Micaela RODRIGUEZ de Montemayor.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Maria de Jesus SANCHEZ. Maria de Jesus SANCHEZ and Joseph RODRIGUEZ de Montemayor were married after 24 October 1750.[2822]
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.raullongoria.net/Genealogy/FamilyTree/b190.html#P1152
2 CONT
2 CONT ===========================
2 CONT
2 CONT 54. JOSEPH6 RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR (JOSEPH5, DIEGO4, MIGUEL3 DEL CANTO-MONTEMAYOR, ALBERTO2 DEL CANTO, SEBASTIANO MARTINS1) 
2 CONT *was born 1720 in Guajuco, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT *He married (1) MARIA-SARAGOSA RUIZ-DE-OCON, 
2 CONT **daughter of JUAN RUIZ-DE-OCON and MICAELA DE TREVINO-AYALA. 
2 CONT **She died Abt. 1749. 
2 CONT *He married (2) MARIA-DE-JESUS SANCHEZ-DE-LA-GARZA 24 Oct 1750 in Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, 
2 CONT **daughter of TOMAS SANCHEZ-DE-LA-BARRERA and MARIA-JOSEFA DE-LA-GARZA-SOSA. 
2 CONT **She was born 21 May 1724 in Nuestra Sra de Guadalupe, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for JOSEPH RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR and MARIA-DE-JESUS SANCHEZ-DE-LA-GARZA:
2 CONT *Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 143.
2 CONT
2 CONT ---
2 CONT
2 CONT Following are likely children of Jose's father, also named Jose (anglicized here as Joseph):
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of JOSEPH RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR and MARIA-SARAGOSA RUIZ-DE-OCON are:
2 CONT *1. i* . FRANCISCO-JAVIER7 RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR, 
2 CONT **m. ANNA-DE-JESUS MIRELES-MOYA, 06 Jun 1747, Guajuco, Santiago, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. 29 Jun 1729, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT ***Marriage Notes for FRANCISCO-JAVIER RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR and ANNA-DE-JESUS MIRELES-MOYA: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 
2 CONC 115.
2 CONT *2. 182. ii. MARIA-RITA RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR, 
2 CONT **b. 1720.
2 CONT *3. 183. iii. JUAN-JOSEPH RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR, 
2 CONT **b. Guajuco, Santiago, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *4. 184. iv. JUANA-MICHAELA RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR, 
2 CONT **b. Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *5. 185. v. ANNA-JOSEFA RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR, 
2 CONT **b. 1712.
2 CONT *6. 186. vi. FRANCISCA-JAVIERA RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR-RUIZ, 
2 CONT **b. 1734.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.somosprimos.com/inclan/albertocanto.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Refers to daughter Ana Josefa:
2 CONT
2 CONT 140. JUAN-AGUSTIN6 SALDIVAR-DE-LA-GARZA (ISABEL5 DE-LA-GARZA-MONTEMAYOR, PETRONILA4 RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR, MIGUEL3 DEL CANTO-MONTEMAYOR, ALBERTO2 DEL CANTO, SEBASTIANO MARTINS1) 
2 CONT *was born 12 Apr 1705 in Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT *He married ANNA-JOSEFA RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR 06 Feb 1732 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of JOSEPH RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR and MARIA-SARAGOSA RUIZ-DE-OCON. 
2 CONT **She was born 1712.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for JUAN-AGUSTIN SALDIVAR-DE-LA-GARZA: Mil Familias III, by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza. Page 95.
2 CONT *Notes for ANNA-JOSEFA RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR:
2 CONT *A.K.A. Mariana Josefa Rodriguez.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for JUAN-AGUSTIN SALDIVAR-DE-LA-GARZA and ANNA-JOSEFA RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR: 
2 CONT *LDS Film #605,181.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of JUAN-AGUSTIN SALDIVAR-DE-LA-GARZA and ANNA-JOSEFA RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR are:
2 CONT *1. i. MARIA-JOSEFA7 SALDIVAR-MONTEMAYOR, 
2 CONT **m. NICOLAS-GREGORIO DE AYALA, 21 Oct 1758, Guajuco, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT ***Marriage Notes for MARIA-JOSEFA SALDIVAR-MONTEMAYOR and NICOLAS-GREGORIO DE AYALA: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 66.
2 CONT *2. ii. TEODORA SALDIVAR-MONTEMAYOR.
2 CONT *3. iii. JACINTO-RAMON SALDIVAR-MONTEMAYOR, 
2 CONT **b. 19 Apr 1742, Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *4. 380. iv. JOSEPH-ANTONIO-DE-JESUS SALDIVAR-MONTEMAYOR, 
2 CONT **b. 28 Dec 1743, Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *5. v. JUANA-JOSEFA-CELEDONIA SALDIVAR-MONTEMAYOR, 
2 CONT **b. 09 Mar 1746, Santiago Apostol, Santiago, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **d. 11 Mar 1745/46, Guajaco, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT ***Notes for JUANA-JOSEFA-CELEDONIA SALDIVAR-MONTEMAYOR: Familias de Monterrey, Tomo 4, by Guillermo Garmendia Leal. Page 136.
2 CONT *6. vi. FRANCISCO-LUIS-FERRER SALDIVAR-RODRIGUEZ, 
2 CONT **b. 22 Aug 1748, Santiago Apostol, Santiago, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *7. 381. vii. JOSEPH-GREGORIO SALDIVAR-MONTEMAYOR, 
2 CONT **b. 1750, Guajuco, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *8. viii. JOSEPH-MIGUEL SALDIVAR-MONTEMAYOR, 
2 CONT **b. 04 Apr 1754, Santiago Apostol, Santiago, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *9. ix. JUAN-JOSEPH-CHRISOSTOMO SALDIVAR-MONTEMAYOR, 
2 CONT **b. 20 Jun 1759, Santiago Apostol, Santiago, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
