2 CONT 94. MARIA-GERTRUDIS5 DE-LA-GARZA-DE-LA-GARZA (NICOLASA4 DE-LA-GARZA-DE-LA-ROCHA, PEDRO3 DE-LA-GARZA-RODRIGUEZ, PEDRO2 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-TREVINO, MARCOS-ALONSO1 DE-LA-GARZA-Y-ARCON) was born 1685 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONC She married CAPTAIN JOSEPH CANTU-RAMIREZ 26 Jun 1707 in Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, son of FERNANDO CANTU-DEL-RIO-Y-DE-LA-CERDA and ANTONIA ORTIZ-RAMIREZ-HINOJOSA. He was born 05 May 1682 in Sagrario Metropolita
2 CONC no, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and died 17 Feb 1737/38 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
