1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Cavazos Garza, Israel. '''''Diccionario Biiografico de Nuevo León, Tomo I, A-L''''',  Universidad Autonoma de Nuevo Leon, Capilla Alfonsina Biblioteca Universitaria, Monterrey, Mexico, 1984, page 34.  …  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''AYALA, Diego de'''.  Militar.  Poblador.  Minero.  Nació en Monterrey.  Hijo de José de Treviño y Leonor de Ayala.  Desde 1635 participó en diversas jornadas de pacificación.  Alcanzó el grado de general.  Dedicado a la mineria
2 CONC  denunció en 1666 las minas que fueron del Lic. Martín Abad de Uría, en Cerralvo.  Tuvo en encomienda a los indios ''aguanas y lisguegues''.  Alcalde ordinario de Monterrey en 1664, 1665, y 1666.  Fué, además, tesorero de la Santa
2 CONC  Cruzada en el Nuevo Reino de León.  El cabildo lo nombró juez de residencia para tomarla a Bernabé González Hidalgo del cargo de justicia Mayor.  Casado enprimeras numcias con '''Ana de Ovalle''', en segundas con '''Margarita de 
2 CONC Sosa''', y en terceras con '''Margarita de la Garza Falcón''', procreo numerosa familia con la cual fundó la hacienda de San Diego, donde murió el 24 de diciembre de 1682.
2 CONT
2 CONT ---
2 CONT
2 CONT Margarita de ZALDIVAR (aka Margarita de Sosa) [74],[388],[400] was born (date unknown). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents: Capt. Vicente de ZALDIVAR y Ressa and Maria de SOSA. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: General Diego de AYALA. Margarita de ZALDIVAR (aka Margarita de Sosa) and General Diego de AYALA were married after 21 January 1653. Children were: 
2 CONT *1. Maria de AYALA (aka Maria de Sosa), 
2 CONT *2. Inez de AYALA Zaldivar y Sosa.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.raullongoria.net/Genealogy/FamilyTree/b248.html#P967
2 CONT
2 CONT ====================
2 CONT
2 CONT 6]	Margarita SOSA SALDIVAR b. 1635, m. bet 1653 and 16, Diego AYALA TREVIÑO, b. 1618 or 1619, (son of Jose TREVIÑO QUINTANILLA and Leonor DE-AYALA VALVERDE) d. 25 Dec 1682, Monterrey, N.L., Mex.
2 CONT
2 CONT *  http://www.vsalgs.org/stnemgenealogy/alonsoes.html
2 CONT
2 CONT ======================
2 CONT
2 CONT 57. MARIA4 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-MONTEMAYOR (LAZARIO3 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-GONZALEZ, BLAS MARIA2 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-TREVINO, MARCOS-ALONSO1 DE-LA-GARZA-Y-ARCON) 
2 CONT *was born Abt. 1633 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and 
2 CONT *died April 16, 1698 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT *She married (1) GENERAL DIEGO DE AYALA-TREVINO October 10, 1673 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, 
2 CONT **son of JOSEPH-DIEGO DE TREMINO-Y-QUINTANILLA and LEONOR DE AYALA-VALVERDE. He was born Abt. 1610 in Mexico City, D. F., Mexico, and 
2 CONT **died December 25, 1682 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT *She married (2) CAPTAIN THOMAS GARCIA-DE-QUINTANILLA April 10, 1684 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, 
2 CONT **son of LUCAS GARCIA-RODRIGUEZ and JULIANA FARIAS-DE-QUINTANILLA. He was born Abt. 1609 in Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico, and 
2 CONT **died 1697 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT *She married (3) CAPTAIN ANDRES GONZALEZ-ESQUIVEL June 25, 1696 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, 
2 CONT **son of BARTOLOME GONZALEZ-Y-OLIVARES and ISABEL ESQUIVEL-DE-GOMEZ. He was born 1642 in Tepatitlan,Jalisco, Mexico, and 
2 CONT **died in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for GENERAL DIEGO DE AYALA-TREVINO:
2 CONT *On December 23, 1682, he signed his last will and testament. Archives of the City of Monterrey.
2 CONT *Marriage Notes for MARIA DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-MONTEMAYOR and DIEGO DE AYALA-TREVINO:
2 CONT **Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara, by Raul J. Guerra., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 23.
2 CONT *Marriage Notes for MARIA DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-MONTEMAYOR and THOMAS GARCIA-DE-QUINTANILLA:
2 CONT **Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 23.
2 CONT
2 CONT ---
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of MARIA DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-MONTEMAYOR and THOMAS GARCIA-DE-QUINTANILLA are:
2 CONT *1. 245. i. PETRONILA5 GARCIA-DE-LA-GARZA, b. 1680, Valle de Santa Cathalina, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *2. 246. ii. CAPTAIN JUAN-JOSE-FRANCISCO GARCIA-DE-LA-GARZA, b. 1683, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *3. 247. iii. CAPTAIN CRISTOBAL GARCIA-DE-LA-GARZA, b. 1687, Santa Catarina, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.somosprimos.com/inclan/garzafalcon.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT MARGARITA SALDIVAR-DE-SOSA  , daughter of VICENTE DE SALDIVAR-Y-REZA and MARIA DE SOSA. 
2 CONT *She was born 1635 in Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Descendent of the Onate Family of Zacatecas. In the book, Mil Familias III, by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza, she is listed as a descendent of the Don Alonso de Estrada, the Duke of Aragon. Page 99
2 CONT
2 CONT A.K.A. Margarita de Sosa
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for DIEGO DE AYALA-TREVINO and MARGARITA SALDIVAR-DE-SOSA:
2 CONT *Marriage source:From the book, Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara, by Raul J. Guerra., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 269.
2 CONT *Mil Familias III by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza. Page 326.
