1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 239. MARIA5 DE-LA-GARZA (MIGUEL4 DE-LA-GARZA-MONTEMAYOR, LAZARIO3 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-GONZALEZ, BLAS MARIA2 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-TREVINO, MARCOS-ALONSO1 DE-LA-GARZA-Y-ARCON) She married (1) FRANCISCO ROSILLO. She marr
2 CONC ied (2) CAPTAIN FRANCISCO DE-LA-GARZA-GARCIA February 19, 1728 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, son of FRANCISCO DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-TREVINO and JUANA GUTIERREZ-DE-LARA-GARCIA. He was born 1635 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for CAPTAIN FRANCISCO DE-LA-GARZA-GARCIA: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara, by Raul J. Guerra., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 50.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of MARIA DE-LA-GARZA and FRANCISCO DE-LA-GARZA-GARCIA is:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. MARIA-JOSEFA6 DE-LA-GARZA-DE-LA-GARZA, b. 1700, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. (2) DIEGO HINOJOSA-DE-LA-GARZA, Abt. 1720; b. November 25, 1697, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.somosprimos.com/inclan/garzafalcon.htm
