1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Diego de Montemayor - nació en 1699 como Diego de la Garza.
2 CONT
2 CONT Se casó con Lucía de la Garza en 1718 y posterior a ello, tuvo un cambio de apellido de Diego de Montemayor, tomando el apellido de su abuela. A partir de 1719 con el nacimiento de su primera hija, aparece como Diego de Montemayor
2 CONC .
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Diego de Montemayor:
2 CONT AKA Diego Joseph de Montemayor & Diego Joseph de la Garza Montemayor
2 CONT (27-14, 81-26 IMIDG] Father recorded as Miguel de la Garza (JMB)
2 CONT Batch C601491 1668-1731
2 CONT
2 CONT Records show Diego de la Garza Villarreal, nieto de Lazaro de la Garza Falcon y Petronila de Montemayor, este nacio el 8 de Octubre de 1699 en Monterrey, sus padres: Miguel de la Garza Montemayor y Clara de Villarreal (JMB)
2 CONT (Per Emma Montemayor-12/8/07) Her study of IGI Batch C60491 1668-1731 showed two Diegos de la Garza Villarreal-one born in Cadereyta married to Antonia de los Rios; and one born in Monterrey, married to Lucia de la Garza, shown as
2 CONC  son of Miguel de la Garza and nieto de Lazaro. I presently have both, not connected--the one shown as son of Miguel de la Garza born in Monterrey and who is also known as Diego de Montemayor. and this (Diego de la Garza) shown as
2 CONC  born in Cadereyta and who married Antonia de los Rios.
2 CONT
2 CONT From all indications the Diego de la Garza, who married Lucia de la Garza and the Diego de Montemayor that is the father of her children, appear to be one and the same person--records show both born in 1699-therefore, subject to f
2 CONC urther analysis, these two parientes(JMB) may be merged.
