1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 142. NICOLAS-JOSEPH6 SALDIVAR-DE-LA-GARZA (ISABEL5 DE-LA-GARZA-MONTEMAYOR, PETRONILA4 RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR, MIGUEL3 DEL CANTO-MONTEMAYOR, ALBERTO2 DEL CANTO, SEBASTIANO MARTINS1) was born 1713 in Monterrey, Nuev
2 CONC o Leon, Mexico. He married JUANA-MICHAELA RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR 16 Nov 1735 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of JOSEPH RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR and MARIA-SARAGOSA RUIZ-DE-OCON. She was born in Mo
2 CONC nterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for NICOLAS-JOSEPH SALDIVAR-DE-LA-GARZA and JUANA-MICHAELA RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra,
2 CONT
2 CONT Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 97.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of NICOLAS-JOSEPH SALDIVAR-DE-LA-GARZA and JUANA-MICHAELA RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR are:
2 CONT
2 CONT 384. i. JUAN7 SALDIVAR-MONTEMAYOR, b. Guajuco, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; d. Guajuco, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. JOSEPH-ANTONIO-RAMON SALDIVAR-MONTEMAYOR, b. 15 Oct 1740, Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 385. iii. JOSEPH-ANTONIO SALDIVAR-MONTEMAYOR, b. 09 Dec 1742, Guajuco, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT iv. FEMALE SALDIVAR-MONTEMAYOR, b. 18 Nov 1745, Santiago Apostol, Santiago, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT v. JUAN SALDIVAR-MONTEMAYOR, b. 1753, Guajaco, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; d. 30 Aug 1753, Guajaco, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for JUAN SALDIVAR-MONTEMAYOR: Familias de Monterrey, Tomo 4, by Guillermo Garmendia Leal. Page 136.
2 CONT
2 CONT vi. JOSEPH-ESTEBAN-NEPOMUSENO SALDIVAR-MONTEMAYOR, b. 05 Nov 1755, Santiago Apostol, Santiago, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
