2 CONT _____________________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT Jose Gonzalez De Quintanilla (son of Captain Bartalome Gonzalez and Ana De Quintanilla) died date unknown. He married Maria De Ochoa on 02 Jul 1671, daughter of Captain Nicolas Ochoa De Elejalde and Isabel De La Garza.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://familytreemaker.genealogy.com/users/a/b/o/Dorothy-M-Aboyte/WEBSITE-0001/UHP-0652.html
2 CONT
2 CONT ______________________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph GONZALEZ de Quintanilla1552 was born (date unknown).
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Maria de OCHOA. Maria de OCHOA and Joseph GONZALEZ de Quintanilla were married on 2 July 1671 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, New Spain.393 Children were: Onofre GONZALEZ de Quintanilla, Alferez Joseph GONZALEZ de Ochoa.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.raullongoria.net/Genealogy/FamilyTree/b106.html#P8447
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT From the work of Miguel A Ayala (webcached 12/27/2012):
2 CONT
2 CONT http://webcache.googleusercontent.com/search?q=cache:http://familytreemaker.genealogy.com/users/a/y/a/Miguel-A-Ayala-TX/WEBSITE-0001/UHP-0188.html
2 CONT
2 CONT Sargento Mayor Diego Gonzalez de Esquivel (b. 1645, d. May 24, 1710)
2 CONT
2 CONT Sargento Mayor Diego Gonzalez de Esquivel (son of Capitan Bartolome Gonzalez Olivares and Isabel Gomez DOMINGUEZ de Esquivel) was born 1645 in Cuencame, Durango, Mexico, and died May 24, 1710 in Valle De Cristobal, Hualahuises, Nu
2 CONC evo Leon, Mexico. He married Maria Petra Ochoa de las Ruelas y Rojo on July 02, 1671, daughter of Captain Martin Ochoa de Elejalde and Maria de las Ruelas de Rojo y Navarro.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Sargento Mayor Diego Gonzalez de Esquivel:
2 CONT
2 CONT a) Born in 1645, Cuencame, Nueva Vizcaya, Mexico, and died on May 29, 1711.
2 CONT
2 CONT b) He married to Maria Petra Ochoa de las Ruelas y Rojo (daughter of Captain Martin Ochoa de Elejalde and Maria de las Ruelas de Rojo y Navarro) who was born in 1640, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. They lived in Villa de Cadereyta
2 CONC , Nuevo Leon, MX.
2 CONT
2 CONT c) Children:
2 CONT *i) Capt. Diego Gonzalez II
2 CONT *ii) Maria Gonzalez de Ochoa, m. Gregorio Fernandez de Tijerina
2 CONT *iii) Juana Gonzalez de Ochoa
2 CONT *iv) Isabel Gonzalez, m. Tomas de la Garza Falcon
2 CONT *v) Juan Gonzalez de Ochoa, m. Maria Andrea de Leon
2 CONT *vi) Alferez Joseph Gonzalez de Ochoa, m. Margarita Leal de Leon
2 CONT *vii) Capt. Nicolas Gonzalez de Ochoa, m. (1) in 1699 to Nicolasa Flores de Abrego o Ayala and m. (2) in 1734 to Isabel de Eribe y Trevino
2 CONT *viii) Salvador Gonzalez de Ochoa
2 CONT
2 CONT d) Then S.M. Diego Gonzalez married a second time to Magdalena de la Garza and had:
2 CONT *i) Francisco Gonzalez
2 CONT *ii) Maria Gonzalez
2 CONT *iii) Josefa Gonzalez
2 CONT *iv) Geronimo Gonzalez
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: Posted by Jose Gonzalez in reply to Maria Catalina Vela, b. 1786 d. 1864 Mier, by Catherine de la Garza Millard.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://genforum.genealogy.com/vela/messages/105.html
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT '''2 July 1671''':  married '''Maria Petra de Ochoa de Elejalde Navarro''' in Monterrey, Nuevo León, Mexico.
2 CONT
