2 CONT
2 CONT 3) Captain Diego Gonzalez de Ochoa II
2 CONT
2 CONT a) Born in 1663, Valle del Carrizal, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, died on October 20, 1728, in Tamaulipas, MX.
2 CONT
2 CONT b) Married 1st wife Anastacia Trevino-Ayala on April 14, 1690. She was born in 1670 in Monterrey, NL, Mexico and died March 27, 1707.
2 CONT
2 CONT c) Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT i) Catarina Gonzalez-Trevino, b. 1692, d. 1715. m. Alferez Pablo de la Garza.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii) Antonia Gonzalez-Trevino, b.1693. m. Capt. Isidro de la Garza.
2 CONT
2 CONT iii) Maria Gonzalez-Trevino, b. 1695, d. 1727. m. Manuel de la Garza Renteria.
2 CONT
2 CONT iv) Diego Gonzalez-Trevino III, b. December 25,1696, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; d. 1762.
2 CONT
2 CONT v) Nicolas Gonzalez-Trevino, b. 1700. m. Ana de Jesus Mireles
2 CONT
2 CONT vi) Josepha Francisca Javiera Gonzalez-Trevino,m. Capt. Bartolome de Elizondo
2 CONT
2 CONT d) Also, married to Ana Maria Caballero Rodriguez de los Olivos on January 9, 1708, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; born about 1688, Guajuco, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, baptized in 1688, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, died in 1756.
2 CONT
2 CONT e) Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT i) Juan Diego Gonzalez Caballero, b. 1709,Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. m. Antonia Margarita Martinez.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii) Maria Gertrudis Gonzalez Caballero, b. 1710; m. Pedro Jose de los Santos; b. Vecino de Boca de Leones.
2 CONT
2 CONT iii) Lucas Gonzalez Caballero, b. 1714; m. Maria Gertrudis Lozano, February 14, 1733/34; b. Abt. 1717,Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT iv) Jose Miguel Gonzalez Caballero, b. November 18, 1716, Monterrey Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT v) Maria Ana Theresa Gonzalez Caballero, b. 1719,Sagario, MX; d. December 31, 1753. m. Gen. Jose Salvador Lozano.
2 CONT
2 CONT vi) Joseph Gonzalez Caballero, b. 1719; d. 1786.m. Maria Margarita Lozano
2 CONT
2 CONT vii) Lazaro Gonzalez Caballero, b. Abt. 1720; m. Maria Catarina Lozano, June 05, 1744; b. Abt. 1721,Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT viii) Maria Margarita Gonzalez Caballero, b. Abt.1723; m. Pedro Jose Cantu, April 26, 1738.
2 CONT
2 CONT ix) Ygnacio de Jesus Gonzalez Caballero, b. Abt. 1724, Hacienda Santa Teresa de los Higueras, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. m. Maria Apolinaria de la Garza.
2 CONT
2 CONT x) Maria Catarina Gonzalez-Caballero, b. Abt.1725. m. Nicolas Joseph Lozano.
2 CONT
2 CONT f) In 1714, he bought La Hacienda de Santa Teresa de las Higueras. This estate is now known as the city of Higueras, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://genforum.genealogy.com/vela/messages/105.html
2 CONT ===================
2 CONT * <nowiki>-----------------------------------</nowiki> +Diego G. de Ochoa  m: 4/14/1690  d: 10/20/1728  Father: Diego de Quintanilla  Mother: Maria de Ochoa<nowiki>----------------------------------</nowiki> *2nd Wife of Diego T. 
2 CONC Gonzalez:   
2 CONT * <nowiki>--------------------------------------</nowiki> +Nicasia F. de la Garza  m: 1719   
2 CONT * <nowiki>----------------------------------</nowiki> 13  Antonia T. Gonzalez  b: Abt. 1700   
2 CONT * <nowiki>--------------------------------------</nowiki> +Isidro de la Garza   
2 CONT * <nowiki>----------------------------------</nowiki> 13  Nicolas T. Gonzalez  b: Abt. 1700   
2 CONT * <nowiki>----------------------------------</nowiki> 13  Francisca X. Gonzalez  b: Abt. 1725   
2 CONT * <nowiki>--------------------------------------</nowiki> +Bartolome de Elizondo   
