1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 14. LUCIA4 DE TREVINO-DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY (CATARINA3 DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY-DE-LA-CERDA, BERNARDO2 DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY, JUAN1 DE CALIZ) was born in Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico. She married MATEO GARCIA-DE-LA-GARZA Abt. 1668 
2 CONC in Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico, son of LORENZO GARCIA-GUTIERREZ and JUANA DE-LA-GARZA-GONZALEZ-HIDALGO. He was born 1646 in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico, and died in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for MATEO GARCIA-DE-LA-GARZA: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara, by Raul J. Guerra., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Pages 34 & 37.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of LUCIA DE TREVINO-DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY and MATEO GARCIA-DE-LA-GARZA are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. MIGUEL5 GARCIA-TREVINO, m. ROSA GARCIA-VALLE.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. JOSEFA GARCIA-TREVINO, m. CAPTAIN LORENZO DAVILA.
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. JUAN-ESTEBAN GARCIA-TREVINO, m. JOSEFA DE BARBARIGO.
2 CONT
2 CONT 39. iv. ANA GARCIA-TREVINO, b. 1676.
2 CONT
