1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 242. JUANA5 GARCIA-FLORES (ISABEL4 FLORES-DE-VALDEZ, JOSEPH3 DE-LA-FUENTES, FRANCISCA2 MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO-NAVARRO-RODRIGUEZ, JUAN-FRANCISCO1 MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO) 
2 CONT *was born in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico. 
2 CONT *She married ALFEREZ JOSEPH RAMON-CAMACHO January 01, 1696 in Santiago Apostol, Monclova, Coahuila, Mexico, 
2 CONT **son of DIEGO RAMON and FELICIANA CAMACHO-Y-BOTELLO. He was born in Coahuila, Mexico, and 
2 CONT **died in Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT ***Notes for ALFEREZ JOSEPH RAMON-CAMACHO: 
2 CONT ****San Juan Bautista, Gateway to Spanish Texas, by Robert S. Weddle.
2 CONT ****Marriage Notes for JUANA GARCIA-FLORES and JOSEPH RAMON-CAMACHO:
2 CONT ****Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 40.
2 CONT ****LDS Film #0167980
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of JUANA GARCIA-FLORES and JOSEPH RAMON-CAMACHO are:
2 CONT *1. i. ISABEL-MARIA6 RAMON-GARCIA, 
2 CONT **b. Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. JOSEPH-ANTONIO PEREZ-DE-CERRALLOS, November 22, 1728, Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. Montanes de Burgos, Castilla, Spain.
2 CONT ****Marriage Notes for ISABEL-MARIA RAMON-GARCIA and JOSEPH-ANTONIO PEREZ-DE-CERRALLOS: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 80.
2 CONT *2. ii. ANTONIO-FELIS RAMON-GARCIA, 
2 CONT **b. January 15, 1702, Santiago Apostol, Monclova, Coahuila, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. JUANA-GERTRUDIS DE TREVINO-GUTIERREZ, November 10, 1728, Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. 1710.
2 CONT ****Marriage Notes for ANTONIO-FELIS RAMON-GARCIA and JUANA-GERTRUDIS DE TREVINO-GUTIERREZ: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 76.
2 CONT
