1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Maria LOBO GUERRERO (aka Maria de las Casas)[663],[885],[2212] was born (date unknown). Marriage investigation #45-34, page 201, names her as Maria de Cordova. 
2 CONT *Parents: Juan Alonso LOBO GUERRERO and Maria de las CASAS.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Luis de MORALES. Maria LOBO GUERRERO (aka Maria de las Casas) and Luis de MORALES were married. Children were: 
2 CONT *1. Josefa de MORALES.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.raullongoria.net/Genealogy/FamilyTree/b124.html#P7432
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. MARIA-ISABEL3 LOBO-GUERRERO-DE-LAS-CASAS (JUAN-ALONSO2 LOBO-GUERRERO-FERNANDEZ-CORDOVA, JUAN1 LOBO-GUERRERO) 
2 CONT *She married ANTONIO URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-VERGARA 1648, 
2 CONT **son of JOSE URIBE-Y-VERGARA-TOVAR and MARIA DE-LA-CADENA-PACHECO. He was born in Wichapan, Mexico F.D., Mexico, and 
2 CONT **died 27 May 1678 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT ***Notes for ANTONIO URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-VERGARA: A.K.A. Antonio de la Cadena Vergara. Source: Origen de los Fundadores de Texas, Nuevo Mexico, Coahuila y Nuevo Leon, Saltillo Tomo II, by Guillermo Garmendia Leal. Page 11. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of MARIA-ISABEL LOBO-GUERRERO-DE-LAS-CASAS and ANTONIO URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-VERGARA are: 
2 CONT *1. 8. i. ANTONIO4 DE-LA-CADENA-LOBO, 
2 CONT **b. Wichapan, Mexico F.D. Mexico. 
2 CONT *2. ii. NICOLAS DE-LA-CADENA-LOBO, 
2 CONT **m. MARIA DE LA CONCEPCION, 1680. 
2 CONT *3. 9. iii. AUGUSTINA DE URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-LOBO, 
2 CONT **b. 1660, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT *4. 10. iv. CAPTAIN PHELIPE DE URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-LOBO, 
2 CONT **b. 1666, Wichapan, Mexico F.D. Mexico. 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.loscuellar.com.mx/index.php?option=com_content&task=view&id=82&Itemid=82
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT MARIA3 DE-LAS-CASAS (JUAN-ALONSO2 LOBO-GUERRERO-FERNANDEZ-CORDOVA, JUAN1  LOBO-GUERRERO) 
2 CONT *She married LUIS DE MORALES, son of LUIS RAMON-DE-MORALES and JUANA DE TREVINO-QUINTANILLA-Y-SALAZAR. 
2 CONT **Notes for MARIA DE-LAS-CASAS: A.K.A. Maria Lobo Gerrero. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of MARIA DE-LAS-CASAS and LUIS DE MORALES is: 
2 CONT *1. 7. i. JOSEFA4 MORALES-DE-LAS-CASAS, 
2 CONT **b. 1652; 
2 CONT **d. Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico. 
2 CONT
