2 CONT Catarina de ERIBE (Uribe)597 was born about 1711. Parents: Capt. Phelipe de ERIBE and Maria de TREVIÑO. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Capt. Tomas Tadeo SANCHEZ. Children were: Tomas SANCHEZ, Maria Josepha SANCHEZ, Joseph Eugenio SANCHEZ, Blas de Jesus SANCHEZ, Maria Gertrudis SANCHEZ, Joseph Santiago SANCHEZ, Maria Alejandra SANCHEZ, Tomasa SANCHEZ, Dion
2 CONC icio SANCHEZ, Tomas Antonio SANCHEZ, Santiago de Jesus SANCHEZ.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.raullongoria.net/Genealogy/FamilyTree/b65.html#P1117
2 CONT
2 CONT =================================
2 CONT 21. CATALINA5 DE URIBE-TREVINO (PHELIPE4 DE URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-LOBO, ANTONIO3 URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-VERGARA, JOSE2 URIBE-Y-VERGARA-TOVAR, PEDRO1 URIBE-Y-VERGARA) was born Bet. 1708 - 1709. She married CAPTAIN TOMAS-TADEO SANCHEZ-DE-L
2 CONC A-BARRERA April 11, 1729 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, son of TOMAS SANCHEZ-DE-LA-BARRERA and MARIA-JOSEFA DE-LA-GARZA-SOSA. He was born June 04, 1709 in Cienega de Flores, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and died January 21, 1796 in Lare
2 CONC do, Webb County, Texas.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for CAPTAIN TOMAS-TADEO SANCHEZ-DE-LA-BARRERA:
2 CONT
2 CONT In the book, Mil Familias III, by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza, he is listed as a descendent of the Don Alonso of Estrada, Duke of Aragon, Royal Treasurer and Governor of New Spain, (Mexico).
2 CONT
2 CONT He is also a descendent of the Onate-Zaldivar Family of Zacatecas and New Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT On May 15, 1755, he founded the town of San Agustin de Laredo (Laredo Texas).
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1767 he received a royal charter (Porcion 10 & 11) from the king of Spain. A Total of 10,628 acres located in Webb County.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: Ranches and Ranching in Spanish Texas by Lyle W. Williams. Page 8
2 CONT
2 CONT Handbook on Texas Online.
2 CONT
2 CONT He and his family are listed on the July 22, 1757 census for Laredo, Texas.
2 CONT
2 CONT Webb County Family Histories Volume I, Page 233.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for CATALINA DE URIBE-TREVINO and TOMAS-TADEO SANCHEZ-DE-LA-BARRERA:
2 CONT
2 CONT Index Marriage Investigation from the Diocese of Guadalajara, by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 258.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of CATALINA DE URIBE-TREVINO and TOMAS-TADEO SANCHEZ-DE-LA-BARRERA are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. TOMAS6 SANCHEZ-DE-URIBE, b. July 11, 1730, Nuestra Sra de Guadalupe, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 54. ii. MARIA-JOSEFA SANCHEZ-DE-URIBE, b. March 13, 1731/32, Nuestra Sr. de Guadalupe, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. BLAS-DE-JESUS SANCHEZ-URIBE, b. March 07, 1735/36, Nuestra Sra de Guadalupe, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. FRANCISCA FLORES, Abt. 1760, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 55. iv. MARIA-GERTRUDIS SANCHEZ-DE-URIBE, b. October 26, 1737, Nuestra Sra de Guadalupe, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 56. v. TOMASA SANCHEZ-DE-URIBE, b. July 11, 1740, Cienega de Flores, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 57. vi. JOSEPH-EUGENIO-DE-LA-CANDELARIA SANCHEZ-DE-URIBE, b. December 30, 1741, Nuestra Sra de Guadalupe, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 58. vii. MARIA-ALEXANDRA SANCHEZ-DE-LA-BARRERA, b. March 13, 1741/42, San Juan Bautista, Lampazos de Naranjo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; d. September 14, 1814, Mier, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 59. viii. ANTONIO-DIONICIO SANCHEZ-DE-URIBE, b. November 08, 1748, Lampazos, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 60. ix. JOSEPH-ENRIQUEZ SANCHEZ-DE-URIBE, b. Abt. 1750, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 61. x. TOMAS-ANTONIO SANCHEZ-DE-URIBE, b. January 11, 1749/50, San Juan Bautista, Lampazos, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 62. xi. SANTIAGO-DE-JESUS SANCHEZ-DE-URIBE, b. Abt. 1754, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; d. November 10, 1807, Laredo, Webb County, Texas.
2 CONT
