2 CONT
2 CONT Generation No. 2
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. JOSE2 RODRIGUEZ-DE-QUIROGA-DE-LA-GARZA (ANTONIO1 RODRIGUEZ-DE-QUIROGA)3. He married (1) FRANCISCA-JAVIERA DE TREVINO-AYALA 28 April 1722 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of GONZALO DE TREVINO a
2 CONC nd MARGARITA DE AYALA-Y-BENAVIDES. He married (2) CATARINA GARCIA-DE-TREVINO-GALVAN 06 Jul 1740 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
