1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Maria Gertrudis Lucia de la Garza1,2.  She was the daughter of 2. Captain Francisco de la Garza II and 3. Gertrudis de Ochoa.  She married (1) Diego de Montemayor3,4,5,6,7,8 06 Feb 1718.  He died 1761. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Diego de Montemayor:
2 CONT AKA Diego Joseph de Montemayor & Diego  Joseph de la Garza Montemayor
2 CONT (27-14, 81-26 IMIDG] Father recorded as Miguel de la Garza (JMB)
2 CONT Batch C601491  1668-1731-----Records show Diego de la Garza Villarreal, nieto de Lazaro de la Garza Falcon y Petronila de Montemayor, este nacio el 8 de Octubre de 1699 en Monterrey, sus padres: Miguel de la Garza Montemayor y Cla
2 CONC ra de Villarreal (JMB)
2 CONT
2 CONT (Per Emma Montemayor-12/8/07) Her study of IGI Batch C60491 1668-1731 showed two Diegos de la Garza Villarreal-one born in Cadereyta married to Antonia de los Rios; and one born in Monterrey, married to Lucia  de la Garza, shown a
2 CONC s son of Miguel  de la Garza and nieto de Lazaro. I presently have  both, not connected--the one shown  as son of Miguel de la Garza born in Monterrey and who is also known as Diego de Montemayor. and this (Diego de la Garza) show
2 CONC n as born in Cadereyta and who married Antonia de los Rios.
2 CONT
2 CONT From all indications the Diego de la Garza, who married Lucia de la Garza and the Diego de Montemayor that is the father of her children, appear to be one and the same person--records show both born in 1699-therefore, subject to f
2 CONC urther analysis,  these two parientes(JMB) may be merged.
2 CONT
2 CONT ____
2 CONT
2 CONT Generation No. 2
2 CONT
2 CONT 	2.  Captain Francisco de la Garza II, born Abt. 1660 in Monterrey, N. L., Mexico.  He was the son of 4. Captain Francisco de la Garza and 5. Juana Garcia.  He married 3. Gertrudis de Ochoa 29 Apr 1685 in Monterrey, N.L., Mex..
2 CONT 	3.  Gertrudis de Ochoa, born Abt. 1666; died Abt. 1727.  She was the daughter of 6. Salvador de Ochoa and 7. Catalina de la Garza.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Captain Francisco de la Garza II:
2 CONT  99-26 IMIDG , also see 36-1 IMIDG  which shows a daughter Maria de la Garza married Lazaro Fernandez(JMB)
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Gertrudis de Ochoa:
2 CONT  99-26, 101-3 IMIDG (JMB)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Captain de la Garza and Gertrudis de Ochoa are:
2 CONT 		i.	Maria Josepha Catarina de la Garza9, born Abt. 1689; died Abt. 1714; married Clemente de la Garza, Gov of Coahuila/Tejas 06 Jul 1707 in Monterrey, N.L., Mexico; born Abt. 1681; died 02 Nov 1751 in Muzquiz, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Maria Josepha Catarina de la Garza:
2 CONT 260PoblMont; Marriage date is either July 6th or June 7th 1707; sometimes aka Maria Josefa & Josepha Catarina de la Garza.(JMB)
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Clemente de la Garza, Gov of Coahuila/Tejas:
2 CONT (381 AP, S-A-G-1977, pg434); Was Governor of Coahuila 1735-1739;(JMB)
2 CONT
2 CONT 		ii.	Juana de la Garza, born Abt. 1690 in Monterrey, N. L., Mexico; married Nicolas Lozano 16 Jul 1709 in Monterrey, N. L., Mexico; born Bef. 10 Oct 1680 in Monterrey, N.L., Mexico; died 30 Aug 1725 in Monterrey, N. L., Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Nicolas Lozano:
2 CONT Christening: 10 Oct 1680, Monterrey, N.L. Mexico
2 CONT
2 CONT 		iii.	Agustin de la Garza, born Abt. 1691; married Maria Josefa de la Garza; born Abt. 1693.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Maria Josefa de la Garza:
2 CONT IMIDG 69-12 [JMB}
2 CONT
2 CONT 		iv.	Captain Miguel de la Garza, born Abt. 1686; died Abt. 1763; married Leonarda Gonzalez; born Abt. 1702.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Captain Miguel de la Garza:
2 CONT 68-2, 72-5 IMIDG-2(JMB)
2 CONT
