2 CONT 68-2IMIDG-2 (JMB)
2 CONT
2 CONT 		v.	Maria de la Garza10, born Abt. 1689; married Captain Joseph Felix de Almandos 06 Jul 1707 in Monterrey, N.L., Mex; born 08 Jan 1691 in Monterrey, N.L. Mexico; died Abt. Dec 1734.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Maria de la Garza:
2 CONT (14-1 IMIDG) & S-A G: Spanish American Genealogist pg 434 1977); article written by NadineMarcia Vasquez.(JMB)
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Captain Joseph Felix de Almandos:
2 CONT As early as 12-7-1714 he bought property in Monterrey from Onofre & Jose Gonzalez de Quintanilla for 300 pesos de oro, en reales; the house had belonged to Jose Gonzalez de Quintanilla Sr.(S-A-G1977). [S-A G: Spanish American Gene
2 CONC alogist pg 434 1977; article written by NadineMarcia Vasquez.(JMB)]
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Captain Joseph Felix de Almandos:
2 CONT Christening: 16 Jan 1691, Monterrey, N.L. Mexico
2 CONT
2 CONT 		vi.	Michaela de la Garza, born Abt. 1705; married Joseph Gregorio Gonzalez; born Abt. 1703.
