2 CONT 46ProtCadreyta) Cadereyta 1779 Testamento.[JMB]
2 CONT
2 CONT 		vii.	Francisco Javier de la Garza, born Abt. 1705.
2 CONT 	1	viii.	Maria Gertrudis Lucia de la Garza, married Diego de Montemayor 06 Feb 1718.
2 CONT
