2 CONT Generation No. 3
2 CONT
2 CONT 	4.  Captain Francisco de la Garza, born Abt. 1593 in Mapimi, Durango, Mexico; died Abt. 1660 in Hacienda, San Francisco, Apodaca, N.L., Mexico.  He was the son of Marcos Alonso and Juana de Trevino.  He married 5. Juana Garcia Ab
2 CONC t. 1635 in Monterrey, N.L., Mex..
2 CONT 	5.  Juana Garcia11,12, born Abt. 1593; died 31 Jul 1682 in Monterrey, N. L., Mexico.  She was the daughter of Lorenzo Garcia and Leonor Gutierrez de Abrego.
2 CONT
