2 CONT 	6.  Salvador de Ochoa, died Abt. 1668.  He was the son of Captain Martin de Ochoa Elizalde and Maria Rojo de las Ruelas.  He married 7. Catalina de la Garza Abt. 1666.
2 CONT 	7.  Catalina de la Garza  She was the daughter of Blas de la Garza, Sgt. Major and Teresa Guerrero.
