1 NOTE {geni:about_me} i. CAPTAIN MIGUEL5 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-VILLARREAL, 
2 CONT *b. October 08, 1699, Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon,Mexico; 
2 CONT *d. August 26, 1753, Presido San Francisco Xavier de Gigedo, Texas.
2 CONT **Notes for CAPTAIN MIGUEL DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-VILLARREAL: Explorer, colonizer, and soldier. Founder of Falcon, Texas.
