1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 384. FRANCISCA5 DE-LA-GARZA-VILLARREAL (BLAS4 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-SEPULVEDA, FRANCISCO3 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON, BLAS MARIA2 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-TREVINO, MARCOS-ALONSO1 DE-LA-GARZA-Y-ARCON) 
2 CONT *was born 1700. 
2 CONT *She married CAPTAIN JOSEPH DE ELIZONDO-VILLARREAL, 
2 CONT **son of THOMAS DE ELIZONDO-GONZALEZ and MARIA DE VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA. He was born 1700.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of FRANCISCA DE-LA-GARZA-VILLARREAL and JOSEPH DE ELIZONDO-VILLARREAL are:
2 CONT *1. i. MARIA-ROSALIA6 ELIZONDO-DE-LA-GARZA, 
2 CONT **b. 1724, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. JUAN-BAUTISTA CANTU-DEL-RIO-Y-DE-LA-CERDA, April 08, 1742, Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. December 11, 1715, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *2. ii. MARIA-NICOLASA ELIZONDO-DE-LA-GARZA, 
2 CONT **b. September 17, 1727, Santiago Apostol, Monclova, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT *3. iii. JUANA NICOLASA DE ELIZONDO, 
2 CONT **b. 1728; 
2 CONT **m. JUAN-JUSTO VILLARREAL-CANTU, October 29, 1748, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. 1710, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT ****Marriage Notes for JUANA DE ELIZONDO and JUAN-JUSTO VILLARREAL-CANTU: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 122.
2 CONT *4. iv. MARIA-MATIANA ELIZONDO-DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON, 
2 CONT **b. 1730; 
2 CONT **m. JOSEPH-LAZARO-CAYETANO DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY, September 26, 1748, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. April 18, 1721, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***d. 1800, Rancho Ojita, Vallecillo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT ****Marriage Notes for MARIA-MATIANA ELIZONDO-DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON and JOSEPH-LAZARO-CAYETANO DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero
2 CONC  Vela, Jr. Page 121.
2 CONT *5. v. MARIA-ANTONIA ELIZONDO-DE-LA-GARZA, 
2 CONT **b. 1742, Hacienda de San Nicolas, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. (1) JUAN-FRANCISCO VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA; 
2 CONT **m. (2) PEDRO-JOSEPH GUAJARDO-DEL-RIO, May 18, 1778, Nuestra Sra de Guadalupe, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. 1735, Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT ****Marriage Notes for MARIA-ANTONIA ELIZONDO-DE-LA-GARZA and PEDRO-JOSEPH GUAJARDO-DEL-RIO: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 24
2 CONC 1 [115-15]
