1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 382. JUANA-ISABEL5 DE-LA-GARZA-VILLARREAL (BLAS4 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-SEPULVEDA, FRANCISCO3 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON, BLAS MARIA2 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-TREVINO, MARCOS-ALONSO1 DE-LA-GARZA-Y-ARCON) 
2 CONT *was born June 06, 1701 in Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT *She married CAPTAIN BLAS-IGNACIO GONZALEZ-DE-MAYA August 05, 1714 in San Pedro, Boca de Leones, Villaldama, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, 
2 CONT **son of ANTONIO MORCILLO-VALDEZ and MARIA MAYA-CARDENAS. He was born Abt. 1677.
2 CONT
