2 CONC AJARDO and ISABEL FLORES-DE-VALDEZ. She was born in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico. He married (2) JUANA GUTIERREZ-DE-MORALES-ARISPE, daughter of JUAN DE MORALES-GOMEZ and ISABEL GUTIERREZ. She was born in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico, 
2 CONC and died Aft. Mar 1675/76 in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for SERGEANT MAJOR JOSEPH DE MORALES-Y-RAMON: Source:Origen de los Fundadores de Texas, Nuevo Mexico, Coahilia, y Nuevo Leon, by Guillrtmo Garmendia Leal. Page 70 and 103.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for JUANA GUTIERREZ-DE-MORALES-ARISPE: Her last will and testament was signed on March 27, 1676. Source:Origen de los Fundadores de Texas, Nuevo Mexico, Coahulia, y Nuevo Leon, by Guillermo Garmendia Leal. Page 131.
2 CONT
