1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT ''Mil Familias III'', by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza. Page 81.
2 CONT
2 CONT =====================
2 CONT
2 CONT Tomas SANCHEZ was born about 1687. Parents: Sergeant Tomas SANCHEZ and Maria BARRERA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Josepha DE LA GARZA. Josepha DE LA GARZA and Tomas SANCHEZ1284 were married after 14 July 1707.417 Children were: 
2 CONT * Capt. Tomas Tadeo SANCHEZ, 
2 CONT * Juan Bautista SANCHEZ,
2 CONT *  Maria Josepha SANCHEZ,
2 CONT *  Maria SANCHEZ,
2 CONT *  Leonardo SANCHEZ,
2 CONT *  Anna Maria SANCHEZ, 
2 CONT * Agustin SANCHEZ, 
2 CONT * Maria de Jesus SANCHEZ,
2 CONT *  Maria G. SANCHEZ.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.raullongoria.net/Genealogy/FamilyTree/b205.html#P1136
2 CONT
2 CONT '''<nowiki>--------------------</nowiki>'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Tomas Barrera Sánchez (son of Tomás Sánchez and Maria Ana De La Barrera) was born 23 Apr 1680 in Cienega, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and died 1740 in ,,,Mexico. He married Josefa Sosa De La Garza on 12 Dec 1707 in Monterrey, N
2 CONC uevo León, México, daughter of Juan De La Garza Montemayor and Maria Rafaela De Sosa.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Tomas Barrera Sánchez and Josefa Sosa De La Garza are: 
2 CONT * +Tomas De La Barrera Sánchez, b. 04 Jun 1709, Cienega, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, d. 21 Jan 1796, Laredo, Webb, Texas, USA.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''___________________________'''
2 CONT
2 CONT 14. TOMAS4 SANCHEZ-DE-LA-BARRERA (TOMAS3 SANCHEZ-DURAN, FRANCISCO2 SANCHEZ-DE-LA-BARRERA, JUAN1 SANCHEZ-Y-ORTEGA) was born April 23, 1680 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and died Abt. 1739. He married MAR
2 CONC IA-JOSEFA DE-LA-GARZA-SOSA December 12, 1707 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of JUAN DE-LA-GARZA-MONTEMAYOR and MARIA DE SOSA. She was born 1690.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of TOMAS SANCHEZ-DE-LA-BARRERA and MARIA-JOSEFA DE-LA-GARZA-SOSA are:
2 CONT
2 CONT 22. i. ANA-MARIA  SANCHEZ-DE-LA-BARRERA, b. 1720.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. JOSEFA SANCHEZ-DE-LA-GARZA, m. JOSE-PRUDENCIO GARCIA-DE-LAS-CASAS; b. 1719, Laredo, Webb County, Texas.
2 CONT
2 CONT 23. iii. JOSEPH-LEONARDO SANCHEZ-DE-LA-GARZA, b. Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon Mexico; d. Aft. September 16, 1790, Laredo, Webb County, Texas.
2 CONT
2 CONT 24. iv. CAPTAIN TOMAS-TADEO SANCHEZ-DE-LA-BARRERA, b. June 04, 1709, Cienega de Flores, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; d. January 21, 1796, Laredo, Webb County, Texas.
2 CONT
2 CONT 25. v. ANA-MARIA-ROSA SANCHEZ-DE-LA-BARRERA, b. 1715.
2 CONT
2 CONT 26. vi. JUAN-BAUTISTA SANCHEZ-DE-LA-GARZA, b. 1718; d. June 07, 1778, Revilla, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 27. vii. MARIA-GERTRUDIS SANCHEZ-DE-LA-BARRERA, b. November 27, 1718, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 28. viii. AGUSTIN SANCHEZ-DE-LA-GARZA, b. February 17, 1722/23, Nuestra Sra de Guadalupe, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT ix. JOAQUIN SANCHEZ-DE-LA-GARZA, b. February 17, 1722/23.
2 CONT
2 CONT x. MARIA-DE-JESUS SANCHEZ-DE-LA-GARZA, b. May 21, 1724, Nuestra Sra de Guadalupe, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. JOSEPH RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR, October 24, 1750, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; b. 1720, Guajuco, N
2 CONC uevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sources:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ''Mil Familias III'', by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza. Page 81.
2 CONT
2 CONT ''A History of New Mexico'' by Gaspar Perez de Villagra, Alcala - 1610, translated by Gilberto Espinosa.
2 CONT
2 CONT ''Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara'', by Raul J. Guerra, Nadine M. Vasquez, Balomero Vela, Jr., page 199.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Sources:  Ranches and Ranching in Spanish Texas by Lyle W. Williams. Page 8.  Handbook of Texas on Line
2 CONT
2 CONT Descendent of Don Alonso of Estrada, Duke of Aragon, Royal Treasurer and Governor of New Spain.    He is also a descendent of the Onate/Zaldivar Family of Zacatecas and New Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
