1 NOTE {geni:about_me}   19 CAPTAIN MANUEL5 GONZALEZ-AMAYA-DE-PAREDES-MORALES (JOSEFA4  MORALES-DE-LAS-CASAS, MARIA3 DE-LAS-CASAS, JUAN-ALONSO2  LOBO-GUERRERO-FERNANDEZ-CORDOVA, JUAN1 LOBO-GUERRERO) was born 1682 in  Saltillo, Coahuila, 
2 CONC Mexico, and died 29 Jul 1750 in Boca de Leones, Nuevo  Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT . He married (2) JOSEFA DE  VILLARREAL-TREVINO 1722 in Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of  FRANCISCO DE VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA and PHELIPA DE TREVINO-RENTERIA. She was  born 1700 in Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONC
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for CAPTAIN MANUEL GONZALEZ-AMAYA-DE-PAREDES-MORALES: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Source:Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara,  by Raul J. Guerra., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 192 & 227. 
2 CONT
2 CONT  Child of MANUEL GONZALEZ-AMAYA-DE-PAREDES-MORALES and JOSEFA DE  VILLARREAL-TREVINO is:  
2 CONT
2 CONT vi. JOSEPH MANUEL GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES, d. 05 Dec 1727, San Pedro,  Boca de Leones, Villaldama, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT
2 CONT xi. ANDRES GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-VILLARREAL, b. 1730, Boca de Leones,  Villaldama, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. MARGARITA FERNANDEZ-CANTU, 10 Nov 1771,  San Pedro, Boca de Leones, Villaladama, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; b. 1752, Boca de  Leones,
2 CONC  Villaldama, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 44. xii. MARIA-RITA GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-VILLARREAL, b. 1732, Boca de  Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; d. 1781, Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT
2 CONT xiii. PRUDENCIO GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-VILLARREAL, b. 1740; m. (1)  JUANA CLEMENCIA DE VILLARREAL-MADRAZO, 15 Nov 1766, Boca de Leones, Nuevo  Leon, Mexico; m. (2) MARIA-THERESA-DE-JESUS GALINDO-VILLARREAL, 07 Jan 1772,  San Pedro, B
2 CONC oca de Leones, Villaladama, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for PRUDENCIO GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-VILLARREAL and  JUANA DE VILLARREAL-MADRAZO: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage source:Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese  of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerrera, 
2 CONT
2 CONT Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. 1751-1779. Page 108. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 45. xiv. FRANCISCO-JOSE GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-VILLARREAL, b. 1745. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 46. xv. BLAS-MARIA GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-VILLARREAL, b. 1746. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 47. xvi. MANUEL6 GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-VILLARREAL
2 CONT
2 CONT He married (1) MARIA-JOSEFA DE VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA 29 Aug  1707 in Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of JUAN DE VILLARREAL and LUISA DE-LA-GARZA-GARCIA. She was born 04 Apr 1684 in Boca de  Leones, Villala
2 CONC dama,Nuevo Leon,Mexico
2 CONT
