1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Andres Gonzalez was Alferez Mayor del Nuevo Reino de Leon (Alferez meant Chief Ensign of the Kingdom).
2 CONT
2 CONT   He was Municipal president of Monterrey on three different occasions.Aparently each term was of one year duration.
2 CONT
2 CONT   He served in 1684 and again in 1685, 1690 and 1992.
2 CONT
2 CONT   He was a Captain in the Military forces of Monterrey
2 CONT
2 CONT One of his marriages was to 
2 CONT *ii. ISABEL MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO, d. Abt. 1698; m. CAPTAIN ANDRES GONZALEZ-ESQUIVEL, August 30, 1694, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; b. 1642, Tepatitlan, Jalisco, Mexico; d. Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico
2 CONT
2 CONT daughter of:
2 CONT * ALFEREZ JUAN  MARTIN-GUAJARDO (JUAN MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO, JUAN-FRANCISCO) was born 1650 in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico. He married ANA-CLARA DE AGUIRRE, daughter of PEDRO DE AGUIRRE and ANTONIA GUILLEN-DE-ABREGO. She was born 1654 i
2 CONC n Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico
2 CONT
