2 CONC RA-CANAMAR Sep 1694 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, son of VICENTE GUERRA-CANAMAR-VELA and DOMINGA. He was born 19 Mar 1663/64 in Villa de Santa Maria de los Lagos, Jalisco, Mexico, and died Dec 1718 in C
