1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Maria de la CERDA932,962 was born (date unknown). She was a first cousin of the other Maria de la Cerda who married Thomas Flores. Parents: Sgt. Bernardo de los SANTOS COY and Ines de la CERDA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Diego FERNANDEZ DE CASTRO. Maria de la CERDA and Diego FERNANDEZ DE CASTRO were married. Children were: Juan FERNANDEZ DE CASTRO, Diego Laurel FERNANDEZ DE CASTRO, Jacinta FERNANDEZ de Castro.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.raullongoria.net/Genealogy/FamilyTree/b40.html#P8282
2 CONT =======================================
2 CONT 7. ANA-MARIA3 DE-LA-CERDA-Y-PORCALLO (BERNARDO2 DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY, JUAN1 DE CALIZ) was born 1630, and died October 04, 1707 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. She married CAPTAIN DIEGO FERNANDEZ-DE-CASTRO-RODRIGUEZ 1648, son of GON
2 CONC ZALO FERNANDEZ-DE-CASTRO-RENTERIA and MARIA-INES RODRIGUEZ-TREVINO. He was born Abt. 1623, and died April 18, 1672 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for ANA-MARIA DE-LA-CERDA-Y-PORCALLO and DIEGO FERNANDEZ-DE-CASTRO-RODRIGUEZ: Historia del Nuevo Reino de Leon by Eugenio del Hoyo.
2 CONT
2 CONT Origen de los Fundadores de Texas, Nuevo Mexico, Coahulia, y Nuevo Leon, by Guillermo Garmendia Leal. (page 76).
2 CONT
2 CONT  Children of ANA-MARIA DE-LA-CERDA-Y-PORCALLO and DIEGO FERNANDEZ-DE-CASTRO-RODRIGUEZ are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. ANA4 FERNANDEZ-DE-CASTRO-Y-DE-LA-CERDA.
2 CONT
2 CONT 19. ii. JOSEFA FERNANDEZ-DE-CASTRO-Y-DE-LA-CERDA, b. 1652, Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 20. iii. NICOLASA FERNANDEZ-DE-CASTRO-Y-DE-LA-CERDA, b. 1654; d. October 27, 1725.
2 CONT
2 CONT 21. iv. JUAN FERNANDEZ-DE-CASTRO-Y-DE-LA-CERDA, b. 1655; d. 1702.
2 CONT
2 CONT 22. v. JACINTA FERNANDEZ-DE-CASTRO-Y-DE-LA-CERDA, b. 1659; d. 1739.
2 CONT
2 CONT 23. vi. DIEGO LAUREL-FERNANDEZ-DE-CASTRO-Y-DE-LA-CERDA, b. August 09, 1669, Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
