2 CONT Patricia LONGORIA134,828,2428 was born on 15 April 1960.22 The 1860 Census listed her age as 1. Seabury and James H. Edwards in his affidavit gave her name as Patricia. However, in his affidavit, Eulalio Elizondo gave her name as 
2 CONC Patrocinia. Since Eulalio knew her personally as her second husband it would be natural to assume her correct name to be Patrocinia. However, her currently living descendants all knew her as Patricia and that makes it indisputable
2 CONC  that her name was Patricia, not Patrocinia. Parents: Eugenio LONGORIA Flores and Gregoria YBARRA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Serapio CANTU. Patricia LONGORIA and Serapio CANTU134,828 were married. They lived in Los Villarreales ranch in Mexico. Children were: Lucia CANTU, Juan CANTU, Jose CANTU, Jesusa CANTU, Francisca CANTU, Emilio CANTU.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Eulalio ELIZONDO. Patricia LONGORIA and Eulalio ELIZONDO were married.
