2 CONT 24. Lorenzo Longoria Salazar, born Abt. 1629 in Monterrey. He was the son of 48. Lorenzo Longoria Suárez and 49. Ana de Salazar. He married 25. Antonia Rodríguez. 
2 CONT        25. Antonia Rodríguez. She was the daughter of 50. Fernando Pérez and 51. Andrea Rodríguez. 
2 CONT
2 CONT        Children of Lorenzo Salazar and Antonia Rodríguez are: 
2 CONT
2 CONT   12 i.   Pedro Longoria Rodríguez, born Abt. 1644; married Agustina García de Quintantilla 8-7-1678 in Monterrey. 
2 CONT
2 CONT    ii.   Francisco de Longoria. 
2 CONT
