2 CONT        12. Pedro Longoria Rodríguez, born Abt. 1644. He was the son of 24. Lorenzo Longoria Salazar and 25. Antonia Rodríguez. He married 13. Agustina García de Quintantilla 8-7-1678 in Monterrey. 
2 CONT        13. Agustina García de Quintantilla, born Abt. 1660 in Monterrey. She was the daughter of 26. Diego García Quintanilla and 27. María Saldivar de Sosa. 
