1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Juan Diego LONGORIA Garcia 
2 CONT *was born about 1678 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, New Spain.[430] 
2 CONT *He died by 1757 at the age of 79. 
2 CONT *He does not appear in the Camargo Census of July 12, 1757. 
2 CONT *Parents: Pedro LONGORIA Rodriguez and Augustina GARCIA.
2 CONT *Spouse: Maria Clara de CHAPA. Maria Clara de CHAPA and Juan Diego LONGORIA Garcia were married on 30 July 1718 in Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, New Spain.[433] 
2 CONT *The Camargo Census of May 31, 1750, showed Diego Longoria as a widower. Children living in his household at that time were 
2 CONT **1. Antonio (30), 
2 CONT **2. Anna Maria (20), 
2 CONT **3. Juana Rosa (20), 
2 CONT **4. Joseph Vicente (18), 
2 CONT **5. Juana Anastacia (18), 
2 CONT **6. Pedro (17), and 
2 CONT **7. Petra (16). 
2 CONT *The Census indicated that he had "todas armas" (all arms) and that his assets included "setecientos cabezas de ganado de pelo y lana [700 head of goats and sheep], sesenta bestias caballares de cria [60 mules? for breeding], ocho
2 CONC  caballos mansos [8 tame horses], [and] cuatro bacas paridas [4 cows with calves]". 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children were: 
2 CONT *1. Maria Agustina LONGORIA Garcia, 
2 CONT *2. Maria Agueda LONGORIA Chapa, 
2 CONT *3. Jose Antonio LONGORIA Chapa, 
2 CONT *4. Tomas LONGORIA Chapa, 
2 CONT *5. Jose Matias LONGORIA Chapa, 
2 CONT *6. Maria Gertrudis LONGORIA Chapa, 
2 CONT *7. Ana Maria LONGORIA Chapa, 
2 CONT *8. Juana Rosa LONGORIA Chapa, 
2 CONT *9. Jose Vicente LONGORIA Chapa, 
2 CONT *10. Juana Anastacia LONGORIA Chapa, 
2 CONT *11. Pedro LONGORIA Chapa, 
2 CONT *12. Petra LONGORIA Chapa.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Tomasa de la CADENA de la GARZANO. Tomasa de la CADENA de la GARZANO and Juan Diego LONGORIA Garcia were married.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.raullongoria.net/Genealogy/FamilyTree/b137.html#P22
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT 6. Juan Diego Longoria García, 
2 CONT *born Abt. 1698 in Cerralvo NL. He was the son of 12. Pedro Longoria Rodríguez and 13. Agustina García de Quintantilla. 
2 CONT *He married 7. Clara Chapa Baez Benavides 7-30-1718 in Cerralvo NL. 
2 CONT **7. Clara Chapa Baez Benavides, born in Monterrey; died Bef. 1750. She was the daughter of 14. Capitán Nicolas Chapa Olivares de Treviño and 15. Inés Benavides Báez Flores. 
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Juan Diego Longoria García:
2 CONT *Fact 1: 1749, Original Camargo settler
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Juan García and Clara Benavides are: 
2 CONT *1. 3 i.   María Ageda Longoria, 
2 CONT **born Abt. 1720; 
2 CONT **married Salvador Vela 1735 in Cerralvo NL. 
2 CONT *2. ii.   Antonio Longoria, 
2 CONT **born Abt. 1723. 
2 CONT *3. iii.   Ana María Longoria, 
2 CONT **born Abt. 1729. 
2 CONT *4. iv.   Juana Rosa Longoria, 
2 CONT **born Abt. 1729. 
2 CONT *5. v.   Juana Anastacia Longoria, 
2 CONT **born Abt. 1731. 
2 CONT *6. vi.   José Vicente Longoria, 
2 CONT **born Abt. 1731. 
2 CONT *7. vii.   Pedro Longoria, 
2 CONT **born Abt. 1732. 
2 CONT *8. viii.   Petra Longoria. 
2 CONT *9. ix.   Gertruis Longoria, 
2 CONT **born Abt. 1735. 
2 CONT *10. x.   José Matias Longoria, 
2 CONT **born 1724; 
2 CONT **married María Margarita de Hinojosa Abt. 1749 in Cerralvo. 
2 CONT
2 CONT More About José Matias Longoria:
2 CONT *Fact 1: 1749, Original Camargo settler
2 CONT *Fact 2: 1767, Grantee Camargo porción 93
2 CONT
2 CONT More About María Margarita de Hinojosa:
2 CONT *Fact 1: 1749, Original Camargo settler
2 CONT
