1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 19. JOSEFA3 DEL VALLE (FRANCISCA2 MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO-NAVARRO-RODRIGUEZ, JUAN-FRANCISCO1 MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO) was born in Monclova, Coahulia, Mexico. She married RODRIGO FLORES-DE-VALDEZ-SALAZAR 1655, son of RODRIGO FL
2 CONC ORES-DE-VALDEZ-CARBALLO and MARIA-ISABEL DE SALAZAR-Y-TREVINO. He was born in Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico, and died in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for JOSEFA DEL VALLE:
2 CONT
2 CONT A.K.A. Josefa de la Fuente
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of JOSEFA DEL VALLE and RODRIGO FLORES-DE-VALDEZ-SALAZAR are:
2 CONT * 80. i. ANTONIO4 FLORES-DE-LA-FUENTE, b. Monclova, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT * 81. ii. ISABEL FLORES-DE-LA-FUENTE.
2 CONT * 82. iii. MANUELA FLORES-DE-LA-FUENTE.
2 CONT * 83. iv. MARIA FLORES-DE-VALDEZ, b. Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT * 84. v. MIGUEL FLORES-DE-VALDEZ.
2 CONT * 85. vi. NICOLAS FLORES-DE-VALDEZ.
2 CONT * 86. vii. JOSEPH FLORES-DE-VALDEZ-Y-DE-LA-FUENTE.
2 CONT * 87. viii. JUANA FLORES-DE-LA-FUENTE, b. 1674, Monclova, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT * 88. ix. IGNACIA FLORES-DE-VALDEZ-DE-LA-FUENTE, b. 1676.
2 CONT
