2 CONT 16. JUANA3 DE-LA-FUENTE-MARTINEZ (FRANCISCA2 MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO-NAVARRO-RODRIGUEZ, JUAN-FRANCISCO1 MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO) was born in Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico, and died Aft. April 09, 1683 in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico. She married (
2 CONC 1) JUAN-CRISTOBAL DE CARMONA. She married (2) AMBROCIO DE CEPEDA-CABALLERO 1630, son of MIGUEL CABALLERO and ISABEL DE CEPEDA. He was born in Toledo, Spain, and died Abt. May 20, 1643 in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for AMBROCIO DE CEPEDA-CABALLERO:
2 CONT
2 CONT In Saltillo, on May 20, 1643, he signed his last will and testament. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: Mil Familias III by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza. Page 236.
