1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 1. CAPTAIN FRANCISCO2 BAEZ-DE-BENAVIDES-LOPEZ (GONZALO1 BAEZ-DE-BENAVIDES) 
2 CONT *was born 1594 in Orotaba, Isle of Tenerife, Canary Islands, and 
2 CONT *died 1666 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT *He married ISABEL MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO-NAVARRO Abt. September 1626, 
2 CONT **daughter of JUAN-FRANCISCO MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO and URSULA-INES-CATARINA NAVARRO-RODRIGUEZ. She was born 1606, and 
2 CONT **died July 25, 1693 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT ***Notes for CAPTAIN FRANCISCO BAEZ-DE-BENAVIDES-LOPEZ: In New Spain, he discovered the mines of Salinas and of San Nicolas de Tolentino.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1624, he held the post of Chief Constable of Monterrey. In 1626, he was alderman and a year later he held the position of councilman and procurator of Monterrey. In 1664, at 53 years of age, he was appointed mayor of Salinas Vi
2 CONC ctoria by Governor Martin de Zavala. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for FRANCISCO BAEZ-DE-BENAVIDES-LOPEZ and ISABEL MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO-NAVARRO: Source:The Conquistadores and Crypto-Jews of Monterrey, by David T. Raphael.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of FRANCISCO BAEZ-DE-BENAVIDES-LOPEZ and ISABEL MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO-NAVARRO are:
2 CONT *1. 2. i. LAZARO3 DE BENAVIDES-Y-MARTINEZ.
2 CONT *2. ii. ANTONIA DE BENAVIDES-Y-MARTINEZ, 
2 CONT **m. DIEGO SAENZ, September 09, 1676, Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *3. iii. JOSE BAEZ-DE-BENAVIDES, 
2 CONT **m. MARIA-DE-JESUS BENAVIDES.
2 CONT *4. 3. iv. ANA-ISABEL MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO.
2 CONT *5. 4. v. MARIA DE BENAVIDES-Y-MARTINEZ.
2 CONT *6. 5. vi. ANA-MARIA BAEZ-DE-BENAVIDES-MARTINEZ, 
2 CONT **b. Abt. 1627; d. June 07, 1677, Agualeguas, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *7. 6. vii. CAPTAIN FRANCISCO BAEZ-DE-BENAVIDES-Y-MARTINEZ, 
2 CONT **b. 1629, Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **d. July 1705, Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *8. 7. viii. LUISA DE BENAVIDES-Y-MARTINEZ, 
2 CONT **b. 1640, Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico; 
2 CONT **d. Bef. 1672, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *9. 8. ix. JUAN BAEZ-DE-BENAVIDES-Y-MARTINEZ, 
2 CONT **b. 1645.
2 CONT *10. 9. x. BERNARDO BAEZ-DE-BENAVIDES-Y-MARTINEZ, 
2 CONT **b. 1650.
2 CONT *11. 10. xi. MARGARITA BAEZ-DE-BENAVIDES, 
2 CONT **b. 1653, Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *12. 11. xii. LUISA DE BENAVIDES, 
2 CONT **b. 1672. (sic: likely a death date, and probably the same as child no. 8 - mother was age 66 during this year).
2 CONT
