1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Francisco BAEZ DE BENAVIDES (aka Francisco Martinez)433,434 
2 CONT *was born before 1661 in Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, New Spain.430 
2 CONT *He died in July 1705 at the age of 44 in Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, New Spain.430 
2 CONT **Entry #24-5,on page 94 of IMIG (Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara) shows his name to be Francisco Martinez. I believe this should be Francisco Benavides and is the same person as shown in Entry #
2 CONC 24-31, on page 99. 
2 CONT *Parents: Francisco BAEZ DE BENAVIDES and Isabel MARTINEZ Guajardo.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Clara Flores de la CERDA. Clara Flores de la CERDA and Francisco BAEZ DE BENAVIDES (aka Francisco Martinez) were married in 1682 in Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, New Spain.430 They430 were married. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children were: 
2 CONT *1. Ynes BAEZ DE BENAVIDES, 
2 CONT *2. Joseph de BENAVIDES.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT (Father's generation:)
2 CONT
2 CONT Francisco BAEZ DE BENAVIDES432 was born (date unknown).
2 CONT *Spouse: Isabel MARTINEZ Guajardo. Isabel MARTINEZ Guajardo and Francisco BAEZ DE BENAVIDES were married. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children were: 
2 CONT *1. Ana de BENAVIDES (aka Ana Martinez), 
2 CONT *2. Margarita de BENAVIDES, 
2 CONT *3. '''Francisco BAEZ DE BENAVIDES''' (aka Francisco Martinez), 
2 CONT *4. Lazaro de BENAVIDES, 
2 CONT *5. Lucia BENAVIDES (aka Lucia Martinez Guajardo), 
2 CONT *6. Isabel MARTINEZ (aka Isabel de Benavides), 
2 CONT *7. Bernardo de BENAVIDES, 
2 CONT *8. Luisa de BENAVIDES (aka Luisa de Salinas).
