1 NOTE {geni:about_me} LOBO GUERRERO, Juan. Native of Cordoba, Spain. Born about 1579, settler of Saltillo. Son of Juan LOBO GUERRERO and Dona Juana FERNANDEZ of Cordoba. He married Maria de las CASAS, daughter of Bernabe de las CASAS an
2 CONC d Beatriz NAVARRO. Upon receiving his wife’s dowry, he moved his residence to Hacienda de San Francisco de las Canas, now Mina, Nuevo Leon. He was a regidor (alderman) in the city of Monterrey in 1645.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT 2. CAPTAIN JUAN-ALONSO2 LOBO-GUERRERO-FERNANDEZ-CORDOVA (JUAN1  LOBO-GUERRERO) was born 1578 in Cordoba, Spain, and died Abt. Dec 1659 in  Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico. He married MARIA DE-LAS-CASAS-NAVARRO 1625,  daughter of BERNAB
2 CONC E DE-LAS-CASAS and MARIA-BEATRIZ  NAVARRO-RODRIGUEZ-CASTANO-SOSA. She was born 1604 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon,  Mexico, and died Abt. 1694 in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for CAPTAIN JUAN-ALONSO LOBO-GUERRERO-FERNANDEZ-CORDOVA: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Owner of Rancho San Francisco de las Canas, Marin, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He signed his last will and testament on December 1659, Saltillo, Coahuila. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Source:Mil Familias III by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza. Page 357. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for MARIA DE-LAS-CASAS-NAVARRO: 
2 CONT
2 CONT She signed her last will and testament on March 1, 1694. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Source:From the book Testamentos Coloniales de Monterrey by Lilia E.  Villanueva de Cavazos. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for JUAN-ALONSO LOBO-GUERRERO-FERNANDEZ-CORDOVA and MARIA  DE-LAS-CASAS-NAVARRO: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage source:From the books, Mil Familias III by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la  Garza. Page 355 and With All Arms, A Study of a Kindred Group, by Carl  Laurence Duaine. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of JUAN-ALONSO LOBO-GUERRERO-FERNANDEZ-CORDOVA and MARIA  DE-LAS-CASAS-NAVARRO are: 
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. i. MARIA3 DE-LAS-CASAS. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. ii. MARIA-ISABEL LOBO-GUERRERO-DE-LAS-CASAS. 
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. LUIS DE CORDOVA. 
2 CONT
2 CONT iv. JUAN-LUIS LOBO-GUERRERO, m. MARIA DE ARISPE. 
2 CONT
2 CONT v. FERNANDO LOBO-GUERRERO. 
2 CONT
2 CONT vi. ANTONIO LOBO-GUERRERO. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. vii. JOSEPH LOBO-GUERRERO-DE-LAS-CASAS. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 6. viii. MARGARITA LOBO-GUERRERO, b. 1655.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.loscuellar.com.mx/index.php?option=com_content&task=view&id=82&Itemid=82
2 CONT --------------------
