1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 19 CAPTAIN MANUEL5 GONZALEZ-AMAYA-DE-PAREDES-MORALES (JOSEFA4  MORALES-DE-LAS-CASAS, MARIA3 DE-LAS-CASAS, JUAN-ALONSO2  LOBO-GUERRERO-FERNANDEZ-CORDOVA, JUAN1 LOBO-GUERRERO) was born 1682 in  Saltillo, Coahuila, Me
2 CONC xico, and died 29 Jul 1750 in Boca de Leones, Nuevo  Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married (1) MARIA-JOSEFA DE VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA 29 Aug  1707 in Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of JUAN DE VILLARREAL and LUISA DE-LA-GARZA-GARCIA. She was born 04 Apr 1684 in Boca de  Leones, Villala
2 CONC dama,Nuevo Leon,Mexico.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for CAPTAIN MANUEL GONZALEZ-AMAYA-DE-PAREDES-MORALES: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Source:Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara,  by Raul J. Guerra., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 192 & 227. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of MANUEL GONZALEZ-AMAYA-DE-PAREDES-MORALES and MARIA-JOSEFA DE  VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA are: 
2 CONT
2 CONT i. FRANCISCO-JAVIER6 GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-VILLARREAL. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. LUIS GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-VILLARREAL. 
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. MARIA DOLORES GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-VILLARREAL. 
2 CONT
2 CONT iv. NATALIA GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-VILLARREAL. 
2 CONT
2 CONT v. RITA GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-VILLARREAL
2 CONT
2 CONT 41. vii. JOSEPH-IGNACIO GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 42. viii. JUANA-MARIA GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-VILLARREAL, b. 1711. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 43. ix. JUAN-BAUTISTA GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES, b. 1712, Boca de Leones,  Villaladama ,Nuevo Leon,Mexico. 
2 CONT
2 CONT x. MARIANA GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-VILLARREAL, b. 21 Apr 1718, Sagrario  Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. JUAN-JOSE  CEPEDA-VILLARREAL, 10 Jan 1740/41. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married (2) JOSEFA DE  VILLARREAL-TREVINO 1722 in Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of  FRANCISCO DE VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA and PHELIPA DE TREVINO-RENTERIA. She was  born 1700 in Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
