2 CONT **was born Abt. 1540 in Villa Cangas, Tineo, Asturias, Oviedo, Spain. 
2 CONT **He married Maria Isabel de Salazar Trevino DEL VALLE on Abt. 1572 in Villa Cangas, Tineo, Oviedo, Spain, 
2 CONT ***daughter of Pedro de Salazar and Isabel de Quintanilla..
