1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 231. ANTONIO5 DE MORALES-SALAZAR (LUISA4 DE-LA-FUENTE-FLORES-DE-VALDEZ, JOSEPH3 DE-LA-FUENTES, FRANCISCA2 MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO-NAVARRO-RODRIGUEZ, JUAN-FRANCISCO1 MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO) 
2 CONT *was born in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico. 
2 CONT *He married JUANA GONZALEZ-DE-AGUIRRE, 
2 CONT **daughter of PEDRO DE AGUIRRE-GUILLEN and MARIANA GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-OLEA-CAMACHO. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of ANTONIO DE MORALES-SALAZAR and JUANA GONZALEZ-DE-AGUIRRE are:
2 CONT *1. i. MARIANA6 DE MORALES-AGUIRRE, 
2 CONT **b. October 10, 1690, Sagrario Metropolitano, Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. CAPTAIN FRANCISCO-LUIS SANCHEZ-ARRIOLA, January 10, 1705/06, Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. 1684, Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT ****Notes for MARIANA DE MORALES-AGUIRRE: A.K.A. Mariana de Aguirre Morales.
2 CONT ****Marriage Notes for MARIANA DE MORALES-AGUIRRE and FRANCISCO-LUIS SANCHEZ-ARRIOLA: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 29.
2 CONT *2. ii. MARIA-JOSEFA MORALES-AGUIRRE, 
2 CONT **b. June 15, 1693, Sagrario Metropolitano, Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT *3. iii. MASTER CAPTAIN JUAN-ANTONIO MORALES-AGUIRRE, 
2 CONT **b. 1700; 
2 CONT **d. Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. MARIA-CATARINA DE TREVINO-LEAL; 
2 CONT ***b. 1700; 
2 CONT ***d. Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT ****Notes for MASTER CAPTAIN JUAN-ANTONIO MORALES-AGUIRRE: Commander of the military garrison of Boca de Leones (Villaldama, N.L.,).
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.somosprimos.com/inclan/guajardo.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.somosprimos.com/inclan/salazar.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT ==============================
2 CONT
2 CONT Antonio de MORALES [168],[169] was born (date unknown). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents: Diego de MORALES and Luisa de la FUENTE.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Isabel de CASTRO. Isabel de CASTRO and Antonio de MORALES were married.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Juana de AGUIRRE (aka Juana Gonzales). Juana de AGUIRRE (aka Juana Gonzales) and Antonio de MORALES were married after 9 June 1689.[168] Children were: 
2 CONT *1. Juan Antonio MORALES, 
2 CONT *2. Mariana de MORALES
2 CONT
