1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 206. MARIA6 DE CUELLAR-GUAJARDO (MARIA5 GUAJARDO-FLORES-DE-VALDEZ, ISABEL4 GARCIA-DEL-VALLE, PEDRO3 DE-LOS-SANTOS-DE-ROJO-RUELAS, BERNARDO2 DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY, JUAN1 DE CALIZ) was born in Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico.
2 CONC  She married CAPTAIN ALONSO DE-LA-PENA-LOPEZ Abt. 1690, son of ALONSO-MARTIN DE-LA-PENA and MARIA LOPEZ-DE-LA-CUEVA-RUELAS. He was born in Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico, and died Aft. November 14, 1691.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for MARIA DE CUELLAR-GUAJARDO and ALONSO DE-LA-PENA-LOPEZ: Mil Familia III, by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza. Page 291.
