1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "Francisca Alcoideo-Ascoide", her name is Francisca de Alcocer and that is in the documents of the Archivo General de Indias; also you mention her husband Diego Temiño de Velasco with the last name "Temiño", in the
2 CONC  documents of the Real Chancillería de Valladolid where he -along with this brothers- is claiming his rights to what his grandfather Sancho de Velasco left in his will. There, he is named "Temiño".
2 CONT
2 CONT names listed in the conflict section are: Francisca ALCOCER Francisca ALCOIDEO-ASCOIDE
2 CONT ===================================
