1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Villanueva de Cavazos, Lilia E.  "'''''Testamentos Coloniales de Monterrey'''''," Universidad Autonoma de Nuevo León, Monterrey, Nuevo León, Mexico, 1991, page 29.  [cited in her father Juan Cavazos' 5 January 1681
2 CONC  will]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''____________________________'''
2 CONT
2 CONT 14. MARIA4 DE-LA-GARZA (ELENA3 DE-LA-GARZA-RODRIGUEZ, PEDRO2 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-TREVINO, MARCOS-ALONSO1 DE-LA-GARZA-Y-ARCON) 
2 CONT *was born 1640 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and 
2 CONT *died 17 Dec 1675 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT *She married CAPTAIN IGNACIO GUERRA-CANAMAR-FERNANDEZ 1656, 
2 CONT **son of ANTONIO GUERRA-CANAMAR and CATALINA-LUISA FERNANDEZ-DE-RIO-FRIO. He was born 06 Nov 1633 in Mexico City, D.F., Mexico, and 
2 CONT **died 07 Jan 1702 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''____________________________'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for CAPTAIN IGNACIO GUERRA-CANAMAR-FERNANDEZ:
2 CONT
2 CONT He and his wife, Maria, had nine children.
2 CONT
2 CONT On November 20, 1701, he signed his last will and testament.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''''Mil Familias III''''', by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza. Page 271.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''........................................................'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for MARIA DE-LA-GARZA and IGNACIO GUERRA-CANAMAR-FERNANDEZ:
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of MARIA DE-LA-GARZA and IGNACIO GUERRA-CANAMAR-FERNANDEZ are:
2 CONT *1. 55. i. ELENA5 GUERRA-CANAMAR-DE-LA-GARZA, 
2 CONT **b. 1657.
2 CONT *2. 56. ii. CAPTAIN JOSEPH GUERRA-CANAMAR-DE-LA-GARZA, 
2 CONT **b. 1665, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *3. 57. iii. CLARA-GUERRA-CANAMAR-DE-LA-GARZA, 
2 CONT **b. 1666.
2 CONT *4. iv. DOMINGO GUERRA-CANAMAR-DE-LA-GARZA, 
2 CONT **b. 1668.
2 CONT ***Notes for DOMINGO GUERRA-CANAMAR-DE-LA-GARZA: Remained single.
2 CONT *5. 58. v. CAPTAIN JUAN GUERRA-CANAMAR-DE-LA-GARZA, 
2 CONT **b. 1670, Coahuila, Mexico; 
2 CONT **d. Aft. 05 Apr 1741, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *6. 59. vi. ANTONIO GUERRA-CANAMAR-DE-LA-GARZA, 
2 CONT **b. 04 Jan 1672, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *7. 60. vii. IGNACIO GUERRA-CANAMAR-DE-LA-GARZA, 
2 CONT **b. 06 Nov 1673, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *8. 61. viii. CAPTAIN ANDRES GUERRA-CANAMAR-DE-LA-GARZA, 
2 CONT **b. 11 Dec 1675, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **d. Aft. 07 Apr 1745, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.somosprimos.com/inclan/garza.htm
2 CONT
