2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Capt. Ignacio GUERRA. Maria CAVAZOS (aka Maria de la Garza) and Capt. Ignacio GUERRA were married. Children were: 
2 CONT *1. Capt. Andres GUERRA, 
2 CONT *2. Capt. Juan GUERRA, 
2 CONT *3. Capt. Ignacio GUERRA, 
2 CONT *4. Capt. Joseph GUERRA, 
2 CONT *5. Clara GUERRA, 
2 CONT *6. Antonio GUERRA.
